<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.964" end="00:00:05.294" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.274" end="00:00:05.294" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.300" end="00:00:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.300" end="00:00:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Snake bit you. The poison&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.000" end="00:00:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saved me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.100" end="00:00:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just happened to pass by.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.299" end="00:00:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is deep in the forest?</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.200" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deep enough.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.000" end="00:00:22.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you live here?</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.300" end="00:00:23.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.600" end="00:00:26.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.500" end="00:00:26.200" style="s2">are you the one</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.500" end="00:00:32.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one what? The poison&#39;s gone. Leave</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.900" end="00:00:34.060" style="s2">here at dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.500" end="00:00:35.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.060" end="00:00:36.400" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.100" end="00:00:37.200" style="s2">Do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.400" end="00:00:38.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.200" end="00:00:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t even heard what it is yet.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.900" end="00:00:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t care to hear it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.200" end="00:00:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to die.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.200" end="00:00:47.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.400" end="00:00:49.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sacrifice requires a virgin. If I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.300" end="00:00:51.300" style="s2">not one, they can&#39;t offer me up.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.700" end="00:00:52.700" style="s2">The villagers will be here any minute. I</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.300" end="00:00:53.700" style="s2">don&#39;t have time to find anyone else. You</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.700" end="00:00:54.600" style="s2">already saved me once.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.700" end="00:00:55.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saved you because</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.600" end="00:00:56.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because what?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.400" end="00:00:58.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave before dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.600" end="00:00:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I go out there, I&#39;m dead.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.100" end="00:00:59.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your problem.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.200" end="00:01:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.800" end="00:01:02.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said no.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.800" end="00:01:02.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Search this way. HE COULDN&#39;T HAVE GONE</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.100" end="00:01:04.500" style="s2">FAR.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.900" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IF THEY CATCH ME, I&#39;m dead. I&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.500" end="00:01:07.600" style="s2">absolutely anything, anything. Just</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.400" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.600" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE&#39;S A CAVE OVER THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.700" end="00:01:14.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEY&#39;RE COMING IN. TELL THEM YOU&#39;RE MY</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.300" end="00:01:16.690" style="s2">MAN. PLEASE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.670" end="00:01:16.690" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.400" end="00:01:22.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IVY.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:23.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m no longer a virgin.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.200" end="00:01:26.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.700" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my man. We already</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.800" end="00:01:31.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sacrifice needs a virgin. So she</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.400" end="00:01:32.355" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.700" end="00:01:32.900" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.355" end="00:01:34.200" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.900" end="00:01:36.300" style="s2">WHO ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.200" end="00:01:38.200" style="s2">I&#39;M ASKING YOU. Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.300" end="00:01:39.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who lives in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.200" end="00:01:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You live in the forest? Do you even know</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.900" end="00:01:43.900" style="s2">who she is? She&#39;s the sacrifice for the</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.000" end="00:01:46.700" style="s2">forest beast. Touching her just made you</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.900" end="00:01:48.200" style="s2">an enemy of this entire town.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.700" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This guy lives deep in the forest and</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.200" end="00:01:51.500" style="s2">the beast hasn&#39;t torn him apart? What if</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.000" end="00:01:53.800" style="s2">he&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.500" end="00:01:55.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say he&#39;s your man?</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.800" end="00:01:56.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.281" end="00:01:58.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.800" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.192" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.486" end="00:02:07.992" style="s2">[clears throat] She&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.492" end="00:02:07.992" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to lay a hand on her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.592" end="00:02:12.492" style="s2">Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.966" end="00:02:14.986" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.192" end="00:02:18.192" style="s2">Take her away.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.592" end="00:02:19.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:22.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll have her examined. We&#39;ll see if</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.892" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">she&#39;s still untouched.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.792" end="00:02:26.192" style="s2">If she&#39;s lying,</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:28.686" style="s2">she&#39;s a liar who&#39;s angered the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.192" end="00:02:30.692" style="s2">The sacrifice still goes ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.686" end="00:02:33.392" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.692" end="00:02:33.392" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.926" end="00:02:35.946" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.092" end="00:02:39.166" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.511" end="00:02:41.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.166" end="00:02:41.186" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:48.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, this ran off into the forest,</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.692" end="00:02:51.292" style="s2">claiming she lost her virginity to some</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.792" end="00:02:52.492" style="s2">wild man hiding in a cave.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.292" end="00:02:54.192" style="s2">She actually thinks that&#39;ll get her out</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.492" end="00:02:55.792" style="s2">of the sacrifice? [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.192" end="00:02:57.592" style="s2">We&#39;ll check her at dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.792" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">If she&#39;s still untouched, she&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.592" end="00:03:01.592" style="s2">into the forest by sunset today.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.892" end="00:03:02.892" style="s2">And if she lied to us, do you know what</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.592" end="00:03:03.992" style="s2">happens to someone who deceives the</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.892" end="00:03:06.492" style="s2">whole town?</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.992" end="00:03:08.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not lying.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.492" end="00:03:11.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lock her in the barn.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.092" end="00:03:11.092" style="s2">We&#39;ll check her at dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.092" end="00:03:21.492" style="s2">Check her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.092" end="00:03:24.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:26.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.692" end="00:03:26.892" style="s2">The more you struggle, the more it&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.192" end="00:03:29.492" style="s2">hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.892" end="00:03:29.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.792" end="00:03:38.292" style="s2">Who&#39;s that guy? Never seen him before.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.492" end="00:03:38.292" style="s2">Dressed like that. Some kind of noble?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.692" end="00:03:43.392" style="s2">May I ask who you are?</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.092" end="00:03:44.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your mayor out here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.392" end="00:03:46.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mayor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.092" end="00:03:46.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.892" end="00:03:52.592" style="s2">And you are, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.192" end="00:03:52.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve come to propose a marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.692" end="00:03:58.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Propose to whom?</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.992" end="00:03:58.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.592" end="00:04:03.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s untouched. Still a virgin.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.392" end="00:04:05.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.494" end="00:04:07.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lied, Ivy. Did you really think some</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.694" end="00:04:10.394" style="s2">random wild man could save you? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.694" end="00:04:11.594" style="s2">going into the forest before sunset as a</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.394" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">living sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.594" end="00:04:15.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sacrifice me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.094" end="00:04:17.694" style="s2">And what about 10 years from now? Offer</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.294" end="00:04:19.294" style="s2">up your own little girl next?</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.694" end="00:04:22.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s the mayor&#39;s true daughter, not a</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.294" end="00:04:24.294" style="s2">sacrifice. You are.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.594" end="00:04:25.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, sir,</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.294" end="00:04:26.694" style="s2">a proposal. There&#39;s a man here to</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.994" end="00:04:28.094" style="s2">propose.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.694" end="00:04:29.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A proposal?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.094" end="00:04:30.794" style="s2">For who?</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.994" end="00:04:33.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.794" end="00:04:33.394" style="s2">Miss Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.994" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.594" end="00:04:43.294" style="s2">I heard you came here to</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:44.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.294" end="00:04:46.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.494" end="00:04:48.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came to propose to that bastard? Do</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.994" end="00:04:49.294" style="s2">you even know she&#39;s supposed to be</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.094" end="00:04:50.094" style="s2">sacrificed today?</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.294" end="00:04:53.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.094" end="00:04:53.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.494" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bride price.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.194" end="00:05:01.894" style="s2">Who the hell are you? The lord of the</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.894" end="00:05:03.594" style="s2">estate on the other side of the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.894" end="00:05:04.394" style="s2">Not fond of company, so I never set foot</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.594" end="00:05:05.494" style="s2">in town.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.394" end="00:05:07.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord of the estate?</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.494" end="00:05:10.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear, that gold is enough to</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.594" end="00:05:12.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.094" end="00:05:13.994" style="s2">You want to marry a bastard? A sacrifice</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.494" end="00:05:14.794" style="s2">the whole town spits on? Aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.994" end="00:05:16.194" style="s2">ashamed?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.794" end="00:05:19.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.194" end="00:05:20.794" style="s2">Why would I hand her over to you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.094" end="00:05:22.394" style="s2">She&#39;s already mine.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:23.794" style="s2">Last night in that cave, she told the</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.394" end="00:05:24.494" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.794" end="00:05:25.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.494" end="00:05:28.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the midwife checked.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.794" end="00:05:30.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes it doesn&#39;t bleed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.994" end="00:05:32.894" style="s2">You can keep making her life difficult,</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.894" end="00:05:35.294" style="s2">but I&#39;ll remember.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.894" end="00:05:37.394" style="s2">I&#39;ll come for her in 3 days. The bride</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.294" end="00:05:40.194" style="s2">price on that table is worth 10 years of</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.394" end="00:05:43.094" style="s2">your town&#39;s harvest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.194" end="00:05:45.194" style="s2">Oh, and one more thing. She&#39;s my wife,</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.094" end="00:05:48.594" style="s2">not a sacrifice. Anyone who touches her</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.194" end="00:05:48.594" style="s2">again, I&#39;ll come find them myself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.694" end="00:05:54.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dearest, say yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.794" end="00:05:56.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lives deep in the forest, never sets</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.594" end="00:05:58.994" style="s2">foot in town, carries such imposing a</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.594" end="00:05:58.994" style="s2">era.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.394" end="00:06:02.494" style="s2">Who on earth is he?</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.994" end="00:06:08.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here to drag me to my death?</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.495" end="00:06:12.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a lucky one. [clears throat] A man</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.495" end="00:06:13.495" style="s2">came to propose, paid a fortune, wants</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.595" end="00:06:14.095" style="s2">to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.095" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man from the cave last night.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.695" end="00:06:21.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually came?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.195" end="00:06:23.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He claims you&#39;re already his.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.495" end="00:06:25.595" style="s2">He&#39;ll come for you in 3 days. Stay quiet</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.995" end="00:06:26.795" style="s2">and behave yourself until then.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.595" end="00:06:28.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You agreed?</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.795" end="00:06:31.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The money he gave is enough to feed this</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.295" end="00:06:31.395" style="s2">town for 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.095" end="00:06:35.995" style="s2">I can tell them I wed my daughter off to</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.695" end="00:06:37.395" style="s2">the lord of the estate.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.995" end="00:06:39.695" style="s2">Sounds better than saying she was a</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.395" end="00:06:42.395" style="s2">sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.695" end="00:06:44.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really came.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.395" end="00:06:47.095" style="s2">Why? Why did he come?</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.895" end="00:06:48.795" style="s2">He said no.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.095" end="00:06:51.995" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t matter why</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.795" end="00:06:51.995" style="s2">as long as I can escape.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.795" end="00:06:55.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him? The one marrying the mayor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.595" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">bastard?</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.395" end="00:06:58.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He heard he paid a huge sum.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.295" end="00:07:01.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lives in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.995" end="00:07:01.995" style="s2">Do you think he could be</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.895" end="00:07:14.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just being near her, the pain stops.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.495" end="00:07:17.295" style="s2">5 centuries, tried everything. Herbs,</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.795" end="00:07:20.695" style="s2">incantations, bloodletting, binding</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.295" end="00:07:23.795" style="s2">seals, nothing worked. A human girl.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.695" end="00:07:23.795" style="s2">What exactly are you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.995" end="00:07:28.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, today is your wedding day. The</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.995" end="00:07:30.395" style="s2">mayor has ordered your preparations.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.495" end="00:07:32.195" style="s2">Is this my wedding dress? The mayor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.395" end="00:07:33.295" style="s2">wife wouldn&#39;t give you anything nice.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.195" end="00:07:35.885" style="s2">This is the most decent one I could</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.295" end="00:07:36.695" style="s2">find. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.885" end="00:07:39.295" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.695" end="00:07:42.195" style="s2">One step at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.295" end="00:07:44.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Kane, what a joyful occasion today.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.195" end="00:07:47.795" style="s2">Ivy will be out any second now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.895" end="00:07:47.795" style="s2">Any second now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.995" end="00:07:51.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really came.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.095" end="00:07:52.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I&#39;d return in 3 days.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.895" end="00:07:54.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.395" end="00:07:55.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today I give my daughter Ivy in marriage</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.195" end="00:07:57.995" style="s2">to Mr. Kane, the lord of the forest</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.995" end="00:08:00.095" style="s2">manor.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.995" end="00:08:01.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry them along. Don&#39;t let people ask</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.095" end="00:08:03.995" style="s2">too many questions.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.695" end="00:08:08.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Kane, you may take Ivy now. Wishing</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.995" end="00:08:08.297" style="s2">you both save your wishes. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.397" end="00:08:16.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still haven&#39; answered me. Why did</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.397" end="00:08:16.997" style="s2">you come to propose? You said no that</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.397" end="00:08:19.197" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.997" end="00:08:19.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.197" end="00:08:22.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.897" end="00:08:23.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a sickness.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.197" end="00:08:25.097" style="s2">It quiets when I&#39;m near you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.597" end="00:08:25.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you married me because I can cure</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.097" end="00:08:27.897" style="s2">your sickness?</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.897" end="00:08:28.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not cure, relieve.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.897" end="00:08:30.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I&#39;m just medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.997" end="00:08:31.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can see it that way.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.497" end="00:08:33.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do I get out of it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.597" end="00:08:35.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safety, shelter,</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.897" end="00:08:37.297" style="s2">no more being sacrificed, no more</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.897" end="00:08:38.097" style="s2">walking on eggshells.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.297" end="00:08:40.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.097" end="00:08:42.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that enough?</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.397" end="00:08:43.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sickness you mentioned, what exactly</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.597" end="00:08:45.197" style="s2">is it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.097" end="00:08:47.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to know right now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.197" end="00:08:48.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I married a stranger who won&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.197" end="00:08:49.697" style="s2">anything about himself.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.197" end="00:08:52.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You married someone who can keep you</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.697" end="00:08:53.997" style="s2">alive until you find a better option.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.097" end="00:08:57.297" style="s2">That&#39;s enough. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.997" end="00:08:57.297" style="s2">We&#39;ve a long walk ahead of us.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.726" end="00:09:01.297" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.381" end="00:09:02.497" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.297" end="00:09:04.897" style="s2">Keep up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.497" end="00:09:06.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m keeping up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.897" end="00:09:06.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wound split open.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.276" end="00:09:07.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.931" end="00:09:11.297" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.597" end="00:09:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. I can walk.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.597" end="00:09:14.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this pace, we won&#39;t arrive before</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.597" end="00:09:16.897" style="s2">nightfall.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.297" end="00:09:18.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arrive where? The cave?</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.897" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:22.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.297" end="00:09:22.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll carry you. Don&#39;t argue.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.097" end="00:09:27.891" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re burning up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.297" end="00:09:28.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.891" end="00:09:30.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.697" end="00:09:31.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you running a fever?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:32.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.197" end="00:09:33.597" style="s2">I am always like this.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.397" end="00:09:34.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this another symptom of your</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.597" end="00:09:35.697" style="s2">sickness?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.797" end="00:09:36.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.697" end="00:09:38.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what is it?</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.997" end="00:09:40.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just my nature.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.797" end="00:09:40.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t the right direction.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.297" end="00:09:42.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.997" end="00:09:43.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The cave is east. You&#39;re heading</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.797" end="00:09:45.397" style="s2">northwest.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.697" end="00:09:46.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re not going to the cave.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.397" end="00:09:48.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then where?</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.897" end="00:09:50.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where I live.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:52.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought the cave was where you lived.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.297" end="00:09:54.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was only temporary shelter.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.297" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where exactly are you taking me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.797" end="00:09:59.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to go back to the town?</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.297" end="00:10:01.897" style="s2">Then stop asking.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.497" end="00:10:03.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long have we been walking?</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.897" end="00:10:03.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two hours.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.261" end="00:10:05.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.897" end="00:10:08.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much longer?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.297" end="00:10:08.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost there.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.997" end="00:10:11.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.697" end="00:10:15.798" style="s2">Wild out there?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.898" end="00:10:16.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not animals.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.798" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what was it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.998" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.698" end="00:10:24.598" style="s2">We&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.798" end="00:10:26.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.598" end="00:10:28.698" style="s2">You said you were a lord.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.698" end="00:10:30.598" style="s2">I thought it was a small estate.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.698" end="00:10:32.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not small.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.598" end="00:10:34.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who exactly are you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.598" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you, the lord of the Forest</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.498" end="00:10:37.798" style="s2">Estate.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.098" end="00:10:39.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t an ordinary estate.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.798" end="00:10:40.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never said it was.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.398" end="00:10:42.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lied to me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.398" end="00:10:43.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t lie. I just didn&#39;t tell you</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.398" end="00:10:44.898" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.698" end="00:10:46.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there a difference?</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.898" end="00:10:48.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to know the difference?</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.698" end="00:10:51.998" style="s2">Keep asking. I can take you back to the</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.898" end="00:10:51.998" style="s2">town. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.098" end="00:10:55.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t we going in?</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.698" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">The gate opened by itself?</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.598" end="00:11:03.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s inside.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.898" end="00:11:03.298" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.998" end="00:11:07.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master,</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">welcome home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.898" end="00:11:14.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder. 500 years. I thought I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.798" end="00:11:16.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this is</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.998" end="00:11:17.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife,</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.298" end="00:11:18.698" style="s2">Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.298" end="00:11:19.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.698" end="00:11:20.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.798" end="00:11:22.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.498" end="00:11:23.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, I fear the news of your return</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.698" end="00:11:24.498" style="s2">has already spread.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.798" end="00:11:26.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:27.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So many have gathered. They await you in</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.598" end="00:11:29.798" style="s2">the hall.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.498" end="00:11:31.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them wait. Settle her first.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.798" end="00:11:34.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. This way, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.298" end="00:11:34.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on. I&#39;ll come find you later.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.598" end="00:11:39.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How big is this place?</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.698" end="00:11:41.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; floors in the main hall, eastern and</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.498" end="00:11:43.698" style="s2">western wings, training grounds,</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.198" end="00:11:44.898" style="s2">stables, servants&#39; quarters in the back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.698" end="00:11:45.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Training grounds?</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.898" end="00:11:48.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.798" end="00:11:50.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these portraits, who are they?</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.098" end="00:11:52.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Past masters of this estate.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.298" end="00:11:52.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Past masters. How old is this estate</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.298" end="00:11:54.498" style="s2">exactly?</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.998" end="00:11:55.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very old.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.498" end="00:11:58.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How old?</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.698" end="00:12:01.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over a thousand years.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.598" end="00:12:03.398" style="s2">My lady, your room is here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.398" end="00:12:06.198" style="s2">This is your room. The master&#39;s room is</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.398" end="00:12:07.398" style="s2">at the end of the corridor.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.198" end="00:12:08.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Separate rooms?</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.398" end="00:12:10.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.798" end="00:12:11.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A marriage of convenience.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.398" end="00:12:12.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already know?</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.298" end="00:12:15.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He told me. I stay by his</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.799" end="00:12:15.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; side and he keeps me safe. A bargain,</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.099" end="00:12:17.899" style="s2">nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.899" end="00:12:21.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You take this remarkably calmly.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.899" end="00:12:21.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better than being sacrificed.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.299" end="00:12:31.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; careful.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.699" end="00:12:35.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Human?</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.913" end="00:12:35.933" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.399" end="00:12:41.499" style="s2">What on earth was that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.699" end="00:12:46.599" style="s2">Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.299" end="00:12:48.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.599" end="00:12:50.899" style="s2">All settled in?</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.899" end="00:12:52.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me this was where you lived.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.899" end="00:12:53.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.299" end="00:12:54.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never said other beings lived here</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.699" end="00:12:56.399" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.899" end="00:12:57.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.399" end="00:12:59.999" style="s2">I didn&#39;t tell you everything.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.799" end="00:13:02.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just now I saw people outside.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.999" end="00:13:03.599" style="s2">Their eyes, they were glowing just like</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.399" end="00:13:04.699" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.599" end="00:13:07.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are things you&#39;ll find out</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.699" end="00:13:10.999" style="s2">eventually, but not today.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.499" end="00:13:10.999" style="s2">Dinner&#39;s ready. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.399" end="00:13:16.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin,</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.699" end="00:13:17.899" style="s2">500 years, you finally decided to come</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.799" end="00:13:20.399" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.899" end="00:13:20.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.899" end="00:13:27.999" style="s2">And this is</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.299" end="00:13:27.999" style="s2">my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.099" end="00:13:32.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wife? A human?</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.699" end="00:13:34.699" style="s2">Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.099" end="00:13:37.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, our master has returned and</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.699" end="00:13:41.399" style="s2">he&#39;s brought back a human bride.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.499" end="00:13:41.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A human as our lady?</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.199" end="00:13:48.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.799" end="00:13:52.099" style="s2">Anyone have a problem with that?</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.499" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. Welcome home, cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.099" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hope you last longer here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.754" end="00:14:00.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.599" end="00:14:02.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s our new lady staring at?</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.699" end="00:14:05.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, that&#39;s Lady Lilla,</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.799" end="00:14:06.999" style="s2">the Alpha Wolf&#39;s former wife, wolf</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.399" end="00:14:09.699" style="s2">nobility,</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.999" end="00:14:12.299" style="s2">breathtaking beauty.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.699" end="00:14:15.299" style="s2">Too bad she&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.299" end="00:14:16.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were married before?</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.299" end="00:14:19.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A A time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.701" end="00:14:19.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did she die?</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.701" end="00:14:22.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I killed her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.501" end="00:14:29.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my, our new lady didn&#39;t know?</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.001" end="00:14:31.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My cousin never likes to explain.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.301" end="00:14:34.601" style="s2">You&#39;ll get used to it. Come on, a toast</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.701" end="00:14:34.601" style="s2">to our new lady.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.201" end="00:14:38.601" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.201" end="00:14:43.801" style="s2">We need to make this official. First,</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.601" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">you stay by my side at least 15 minutes</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.801" end="00:14:45.901" style="s2">together every day.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:48.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 15 minutes?</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.901" end="00:14:51.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To ease my condition.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.301" end="00:14:53.501" style="s2">Second, I keep you safe, provide shelter</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.201" end="00:14:54.301" style="s2">and basic needs. I won&#39;t force you to do</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.501" end="00:14:55.301" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.301" end="00:14:56.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything?</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.301" end="00:14:58.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.401" end="00:15:00.901" style="s2">Third, separate rooms. We don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.901" end="00:15:02.201" style="s2">interfere in each other&#39;s private lives.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.901" end="00:15:03.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That goes without saying.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.201" end="00:15:04.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fourth,</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.201" end="00:15:06.401" style="s2">either party may end this arrangement</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.701" end="00:15:07.501" style="s2">with prior notice. No disappearing</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.401" end="00:15:08.501" style="s2">without a word.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.501" end="00:15:11.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all?</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.501" end="00:15:11.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.401" end="00:15:16.301" style="s2">Now, the estate rules. The third floor</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.901" end="00:15:17.601" style="s2">of the east wing is off limits. It is my</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.301" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">private domain.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.601" end="00:15:20.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got [clears throat] it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.701" end="00:15:22.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meals are at fixed times, 7:00 in the</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.501" end="00:15:24.801" style="s2">morning, noon, and 7:00 in the evening.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.701" end="00:15:25.301" style="s2">Miss them and you&#39;ll find your own way.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.801" end="00:15:27.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.301" end="00:15:30.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Address Elder if you need anything.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.901" end="00:15:31.501" style="s2">Do not wander the forest alone.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.701" end="00:15:34.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.501" end="00:15:37.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are things in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.201" end="00:15:39.901" style="s2">Not all of them are friendly.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.401" end="00:15:40.701" style="s2">Any other questions?</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.901" end="00:15:42.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lilith?</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.701" end="00:15:44.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.601" end="00:15:48.101" style="s2">I have matters to attend to. Elder will</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.801" end="00:15:48.101" style="s2">take you back to your room.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.801" end="00:15:53.301" style="s2">Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.401" end="00:16:00.601" style="s2">Cousin, hope I&#39;m not interrupting.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.401" end="00:16:03.801" style="s2">The estate ledgers, 500 years worth.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.601" end="00:16:03.801" style="s2">Time for you to look them over.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.201" end="00:16:08.301" style="s2">Get to the point.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.801" end="00:16:10.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No point, really.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:12.601" style="s2">Just wanted to see you. It&#39;s been 500</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.501" end="00:16:14.101" style="s2">years. The estate&#39;s been stable all</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.601" end="00:16:15.901" style="s2">these years. The business table all</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.101" end="00:16:17.926" style="s2">these, man. I&#39;ve managed it in your</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.901" end="00:16:20.202" style="s2">place. No major troubles.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.926" end="00:16:21.802" style="s2">[clears throat] But now you&#39;re back, I</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.202" end="00:16:24.002" style="s2">suppose it&#39;s time for me to hand over</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.802" end="00:16:26.202" style="s2">the reins.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.002" end="00:16:28.002" style="s2">By the way, that human,</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.202" end="00:16:30.102" style="s2">you&#39;re really going to make her [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.002" end="00:16:31.802" style="s2">the lady of the estate?</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.102" end="00:16:33.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.802" end="00:16:37.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A contractual wife. Cousin, I mean no</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.902" end="00:16:39.402" style="s2">harm, just curious. 500 years and you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.402" end="00:16:40.702" style="s2">never brought anyone back before, and</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.402" end="00:16:42.402" style="s2">she&#39;s human.</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.702" end="00:16:44.002" style="s2">Reminds me of back then.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.402" end="00:16:45.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.002" end="00:16:46.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lilith, when she first arrived, you</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.802" end="00:16:48.102" style="s2">acted just the same</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.902" end="00:16:50.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say that name.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.102" end="00:16:53.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, all right, I&#39;ll drop it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.902" end="00:16:53.602" style="s2">That was out of line.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.802" end="00:16:58.202" style="s2">Cousin, I&#39;m just worried about you. Last</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.802" end="00:17:01.302" style="s2">time you got hurt badly. This time,</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.202" end="00:17:01.302" style="s2">don&#39;t make the same mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.102" end="00:17:06.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did it go?</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.002" end="00:17:08.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He cares about her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.102" end="00:17:11.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That human? No way.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.102" end="00:17:12.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I mentioned Lilith his name. He lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.402" end="00:17:14.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He never loses it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.802" end="00:17:16.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.302" end="00:17:18.902" style="s2">Which means that human girl is far more</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.502" end="00:17:20.102" style="s2">important than she seems. Keep a close</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.902" end="00:17:22.202" style="s2">watch on her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.102" end="00:17:25.202" style="s2">I want to know everywhere she goes,</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.202" end="00:17:26.602" style="s2">everyone she meets, everything she does.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.202" end="00:17:28.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you planning to do to her?</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.602" end="00:17:30.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.202" end="00:17:33.702" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what she&#39;s good for first.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.902" end="00:17:36.702" style="s2">500 years and my cousin finally has a</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.702" end="00:17:39.402" style="s2">weakness. The pity is he hasn&#39;t realized</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.702" end="00:17:39.402" style="s2">it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.802" end="00:17:44.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are these the estate&#39;s lineage?</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.602" end="00:17:46.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lady. They chronicle all the</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.502" end="00:17:47.602" style="s2">past masters and key members.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.202" end="00:17:48.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said yesterday that not everyone</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.602" end="00:17:49.802" style="s2">welcomes me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.602" end="00:17:51.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s correct.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.802" end="00:17:54.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I need to know who doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.502" end="00:17:55.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Know your enemy. Three factions divide</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.002" end="00:17:57.702" style="s2">the estate presently.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.902" end="00:17:59.702" style="s2">The first is led by young master Red. He</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.702" end="00:18:00.502" style="s2">has the most followers, roughly six out</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.702" end="00:18:02.002" style="s2">of 10 people here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.502" end="00:18:04.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six out of 10?</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.002" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The master vanished for 500 years, Red</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.402" end="00:18:07.502" style="s2">reigning running the estate in his</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:09.302" style="s2">place. Most of the younger generation</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.502" end="00:18:11.402" style="s2">only acknowledges his authority. The</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.302" end="00:18:13.002" style="s2">second faction consists of the old guard</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.402" end="00:18:15.102" style="s2">who stayed loyal to the master,</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.002" end="00:18:16.602" style="s2">including myself, about two out of 10.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.102" end="00:18:19.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only two?</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.602" end="00:18:20.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years is far too long. Many assumed</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.202" end="00:18:22.303" style="s2">the master would never return.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.903" end="00:18:24.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the remaining two?</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.303" end="00:18:26.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The neutral ones, they follow whoever&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.503" end="00:18:28.303" style="s2">strongest.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.303" end="00:18:30.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Kane&#39;s return is a threat to Red?</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.303" end="00:18:32.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are remarkably perceptive, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.403" end="00:18:34.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not perceptive, just logical. A man</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.703" end="00:18:35.903" style="s2">who&#39;s held power for five centuries will</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.103" end="00:18:37.103" style="s2">never surrender it willingly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.903" end="00:18:38.703" style="s2">Will Red move against Kane?</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.103" end="00:18:40.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, at least master&#39;s power</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.703" end="00:18:41.403" style="s2">is not something young master Red can</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.203" end="00:18:42.603" style="s2">challenge head on.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.403" end="00:18:45.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what will he do?</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.603" end="00:18:47.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I dare not make idle speculations, but</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.503" end="00:18:49.303" style="s2">500 years ago it was young master Red</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.503" end="00:18:50.103" style="s2">who first introduced his former wife to</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.303" end="00:18:54.003" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.103" end="00:18:54.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.203" end="00:19:12.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get away. Stay back.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.903" end="00:19:12.103" style="s2">GET OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.203" end="00:19:20.673" style="s2">I CAN&#39;T CONTROL IT. ARE YOU DEAF?</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.708" end="00:19:21.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.673" end="00:19:24.303" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.403" end="00:19:27.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU SAID IT YOURSELF. Near me the pain</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.303" end="00:19:27.003" style="s2">stops.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.303" end="00:19:35.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.428" end="00:19:36.803" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.103" end="00:19:38.103" style="s2">didn&#39;t you run?</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.803" end="00:19:39.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.103" end="00:19:40.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.003" end="00:19:42.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost doesn&#39;t count. So this is your</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.803" end="00:19:43.503" style="s2">sickness?</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.303" end="00:19:45.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worst on the full moon.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.503" end="00:19:47.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.103" end="00:19:48.103" style="s2">Every single month.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.203" end="00:19:48.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not afraid?</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.103" end="00:19:49.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.903" end="00:19:53.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why?</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.503" end="00:19:53.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m scared, but I know you need me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.103" end="00:19:59.803" style="s2">Can you stand? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.703" end="00:20:01.103" style="s2">Let&#39;s head back to your room. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.803" end="00:20:01.403" style="s2">freezing down here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.103" end="00:20:03.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.403" end="00:20:05.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll talk tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.403" end="00:20:08.903" style="s2">The contract says 15 minutes a day.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.703" end="00:20:08.903" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t say it can&#39;t be midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.103" end="00:20:19.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breakfast is ready, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.203" end="00:20:19.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.503" end="00:20:24.705" style="s2">Wonder how he&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.405" end="00:20:32.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning, sister-in-law. Sleep well last</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.405" end="00:20:34.805" style="s2">night?</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.905" end="00:20:35.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Just got woken up by howling in</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.805" end="00:20:37.305" style="s2">the middle of the night.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.905" end="00:20:39.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, howling.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.305" end="00:20:40.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably wild wolves. There are plenty</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.305" end="00:20:41.605" style="s2">in the forest, aren&#39;t there?</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.505" end="00:20:42.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re adjusting rather quickly,</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.605" end="00:20:44.905" style="s2">sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.605" end="00:20:46.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adapt or die. That&#39;s the only choice.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:47.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speaking of which, sister-in-law, I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.305" end="00:20:48.705" style="s2">had a gift prepared for you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.605" end="00:20:50.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A gift?</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.705" end="00:20:52.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It will be sent to your room shortly. A</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:54.305" style="s2">small token of welcome to our family.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.705" end="00:20:56.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just you wait. The show is about to</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.305" end="00:20:56.705" style="s2">start.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.105" end="00:21:00.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.405" end="00:21:01.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.705" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About last night.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.605" end="00:21:06.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract says 15 minutes a day. I</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.705" end="00:21:06.805" style="s2">was just fulfilling my end of it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.105" end="00:21:09.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.805" end="00:21:11.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t have to what? Stay near you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.505" end="00:21:14.205" style="s2">See the truth? I married you. For</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.805" end="00:21:14.905" style="s2">whatever reason, I deserve to know who I</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.205" end="00:21:16.605" style="s2">married.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.905" end="00:21:18.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you know. I&#39;m a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.605" end="00:21:20.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I see is a cursed man, not a</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.905" end="00:21:22.605" style="s2">monster. A monster wouldn&#39;t tell me to</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.505" end="00:21:24.505" style="s2">run. A monster wouldn&#39;t fight so hard</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.605" end="00:21:26.205" style="s2">while losing control. I&#39;m going to check</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.505" end="00:21:28.105" style="s2">what gift Red has sent.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.205" end="00:21:30.405" style="s2">My lady, this was sent by Young Master</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.105" end="00:21:30.405" style="s2">Red.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.505" end="00:21:35.005" style="s2">Young Master Red said the finest tailor</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.305" end="00:21:37.705" style="s2">on the estate crafted.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.005" end="00:21:40.605" style="s2">He hopes it meets her liking.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.705" end="00:21:40.605" style="s2">It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.705" end="00:21:44.105" style="s2">This design, I feel like I&#39;ve seen it</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.005" end="00:21:45.505" style="s2">somewhere.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.105" end="00:21:47.305" style="s2">My lady,</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.505" end="00:21:49.505" style="s2">where was it again?</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.305" end="00:21:51.305" style="s2">Do you know? In the dining hall, the</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.505" end="00:21:53.105" style="s2">portrait of Lady Lilith, she&#39;s wearing</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.305" end="00:21:54.905" style="s2">the same one.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.105" end="00:21:57.405" style="s2">I see.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.905" end="00:21:57.405" style="s2">You may go.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.505" end="00:22:01.905" style="s2">Red,</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.505" end="00:22:01.905" style="s2">what exactly are you up to?</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.305" end="00:22:06.705" style="s2">Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.005" end="00:22:08.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.705" end="00:22:11.205" style="s2">What did Red send you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.705" end="00:22:11.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A dress.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.305" end="00:22:18.405" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.605" end="00:22:20.005" style="s2">Pain?</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.405" end="00:22:20.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Throw it away.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.005" end="00:22:22.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pardon?</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.705" end="00:22:25.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said throw it away.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.705" end="00:22:27.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Because Lilith wore the same one?</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.905" end="00:22:29.406" style="s2">I saw the portrait in the dining hall.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.506" end="00:22:30.606" style="s2">Red did this on purpose, didn&#39;t he? He</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.406" end="00:22:32.206" style="s2">wants me to dress up as her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.606" end="00:22:34.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t wear it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.206" end="00:22:36.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not? Because you can&#39;t see in her</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.206" end="00:22:37.906" style="s2">face on me or because of what that</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.006" end="00:22:40.306" style="s2">brings back?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.906" end="00:22:42.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you are not her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.306" end="00:22:44.706" style="s2">You never were and you never need to be</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.406" end="00:22:44.706" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.906" end="00:22:48.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN WHY DID YOU KILL HER?</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.706" end="00:22:53.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS ESTATE</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.206" end="00:22:55.206" style="s2">truly strange.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.706" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.206" end="00:22:59.206" style="s2">Our new ladies out here. Why aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:01.406" style="s2">wearing the dress young master Red sent</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.206" end="00:23:01.406" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.506" end="00:23:04.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not good enough for you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.906" end="00:23:05.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not fit for ordinary days.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.406" end="00:23:07.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not fit</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.606" end="00:23:07.806" style="s2">or too scared to wear it?</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.305" end="00:23:09.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.806" end="00:23:10.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard it&#39;s the exact same dress Lady</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.406" end="00:23:12.806" style="s2">Lillian wore.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.706" end="00:23:15.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A pity. Even in that dress she&#39;s not fit</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.806" end="00:23:18.606" style="s2">to hold a candle to Lillian. Human.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.806" end="00:23:20.406" style="s2">Do you even understand your place here?</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.606" end="00:23:21.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The alpha&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.406" end="00:23:22.806" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.006" end="00:23:24.506" style="s2">The alpha&#39;s wife? You think a scrap of</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.806" end="00:23:28.506" style="s2">contractor makes you the lady of this</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.506" end="00:23:28.506" style="s2">estate? To us you&#39;re nothing but a</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.921" end="00:23:33.506" style="s2">[gasps] Under werewolf hierarchy the</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.206" end="00:23:34.806" style="s2">alpha&#39;s mate holds rank second only to</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.506" end="00:23:37.406" style="s2">the alpha himself. Whether you</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.806" end="00:23:40.906" style="s2">acknowledge me or not those are your own</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.406" end="00:23:43.406" style="s2">pack laws. I do not demand your respect</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.906" end="00:23:46.206" style="s2">but laying hands on your lady in public</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.406" end="00:23:47.906" style="s2">is this standard pack conduct or merely</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.206" end="00:23:49.406" style="s2">your personal choice?</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.906" end="00:23:51.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does she know all of this?</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.406" end="00:23:53.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this is pack custom I will bring it</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.106" end="00:23:55.606" style="s2">to Kane and let him pass judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.706" end="00:24:01.306" style="s2">If it&#39;s personal</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.606" end="00:24:01.306" style="s2">then you&#39;d better think twice. You wait.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.406" end="00:24:04.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.636" end="00:24:05.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.206" end="00:24:07.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.206" end="00:24:09.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From the training grounds. I happened to</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.206" end="00:24:11.106" style="s2">pass by and witness it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.806" end="00:24:13.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Witnessed what?</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.106" end="00:24:14.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A human woman shutting Selena up with</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.106" end="00:24:16.406" style="s2">our own rules.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.806" end="00:24:18.706" style="s2">Who taught you those?</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.406" end="00:24:20.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.706" end="00:24:22.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put them to good use.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.406" end="00:24:24.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pick things up quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.206" end="00:24:26.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Intriguing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.106" end="00:24:29.307" style="s2">Selena won&#39;t let this slide.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.806" end="00:24:30.807" style="s2">Next time she won&#39;t just shove you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.307" end="00:24:34.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what should I do?</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.807" end="00:24:34.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t trust anyone&#39;s kindness.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.908" end="00:24:37.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.107" end="00:24:44.807" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.607" end="00:24:44.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; want to ask you something.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.007" end="00:24:47.507" style="s2">Lilith.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.908" end="00:24:51.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing to say.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.408" end="00:24:53.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.307" end="00:24:54.107" style="s2">or you can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.007" end="00:24:56.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; there a difference?</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.107" end="00:24:58.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Not wanting to is your choice. Not</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.908" end="00:25:01.908" style="s2">being able to means</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.908" end="00:25:03.307" style="s2">something&#39;s holding you back.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.908" end="00:25:06.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you testing me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.307" end="00:25:06.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying to understand my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.517" end="00:25:08.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.807" end="00:25:09.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a contract husband.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.507" end="00:25:12.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A contractual husband is still a</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.908" end="00:25:14.607" style="s2">husband. I live in your estate and spend</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.207" end="00:25:18.007" style="s2">15 minutes with you each day.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.607" end="00:25:18.007" style="s2">I deserve to know some truths.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.607" end="00:25:21.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want to know?</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.272" end="00:25:24.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.607" end="00:25:24.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you kill her?</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.207" end="00:25:30.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is what you came to ask?</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.908" end="00:25:33.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. When Red sent me that dress, your</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.607" end="00:25:36.207" style="s2">reaction wasn&#39;t grief. It was anger.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.908" end="00:25:38.908" style="s2">You killed your wife, yet anything tied</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.207" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">to her fills you with anger. That means</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.908" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough!</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.807" end="00:25:45.707" style="s2">You do not want to hear this story.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.007" end="00:25:47.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.707" end="00:25:48.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What difference would it make?</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.408" end="00:25:50.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least I could judge.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.307" end="00:25:53.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Judge what? Whether I&#39;m someone who&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.307" end="00:25:55.607" style="s2">hurt you? I have killed many people.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.408" end="00:25:56.707" style="s2">She was only one of them. Do you still</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.607" end="00:25:58.807" style="s2">wish to know?</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.707" end="00:26:00.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I want to know is, did you kill her</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.807" end="00:26:03.507" style="s2">because she deserved it</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.607" end="00:26:06.707" style="s2">or because you lost control?</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.507" end="00:26:06.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You truly are nothing like her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.807" end="00:26:11.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll find the answers myself.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.207" end="00:26:13.007" style="s2">Elder, I need to ask you something.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.307" end="00:26:14.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.007" end="00:26:16.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lilith.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.507" end="00:26:17.607" style="s2">I want to know everything about her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.307" end="00:26:20.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, this matter</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.607" end="00:26:21.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know Cain killed her. I want to know</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.007" end="00:26:23.707" style="s2">why.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.207" end="00:26:24.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The master&#39;s past is not mine to tell.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.707" end="00:26:26.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what can you tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.807" end="00:26:28.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lady Lilith</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.207" end="00:26:29.107" style="s2">was the master&#39;s fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.107" end="00:26:31.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mate?</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.107" end="00:26:33.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In Wolf Clan legend, every wolf has one</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.307" end="00:26:34.609" style="s2">true fated mate, a soul perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.109" end="00:26:36.509" style="s2">aligned with their own. When a wolf</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.609" end="00:26:38.709" style="s2">finds their fated mate, their power</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.509" end="00:26:40.609" style="s2">surges and even their curses ease.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.709" end="00:26:41.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Kane found Lilith?</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.609" end="00:26:43.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.809" end="00:26:46.609" style="s2">500 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.509" end="00:26:48.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then she betrayed him.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.609" end="00:26:48.909" style="s2">Didn&#39;t she?</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.009" end="00:26:51.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.909" end="00:26:52.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How? How did she betray him?</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.009" end="00:26:54.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is something you must ask the</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.609" end="00:26:55.509" style="s2">master himself.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.309" end="00:26:57.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.509" end="00:26:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then neither can I.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.009" end="00:27:01.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there anything you can tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.709" end="00:27:02.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is one thing perhaps you should</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.609" end="00:27:03.209" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.309" end="00:27:06.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.209" end="00:27:09.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lady Lilith was introduced to the master</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.309" end="00:27:10.309" style="s2">by young master Red.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.109" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red?</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.309" end="00:27:13.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.209" end="00:27:15.809" style="s2">500 years ago, young master Red claimed</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.809" end="00:27:17.609" style="s2">he&#39;d encountered a woman outside,</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.809" end="00:27:20.109" style="s2">recognized her as the master&#39;s fated</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.609" end="00:27:21.509" style="s2">mate, and brought her here on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.109" end="00:27:23.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did he recognize her?</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.509" end="00:27:25.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mates carry a unique scent only</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.509" end="00:27:27.609" style="s2">werewolves can detect.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.109" end="00:27:28.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman Red brought</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.609" end="00:27:30.309" style="s2">betrayed Kane.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.909" end="00:27:32.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady,</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.309" end="00:27:36.609" style="s2">that is all I may say.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.409" end="00:27:36.609" style="s2">The rest you must judge for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.209" end="00:27:41.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.309" end="00:27:41.309" style="s2">what are you hiding?</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.609" end="00:27:45.509" style="s2">Here&#39;s your coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.909" end="00:27:52.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.109" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.009" end="00:27:54.109" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:55.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pardon?</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.109" end="00:27:57.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take this seat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.709" end="00:27:59.809" style="s2">It&#39;s easier for reading.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.509" end="00:28:02.509" style="s2">We agreed on 15 minutes a day. Time&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.809" end="00:28:02.509" style="s2">not up yet.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.209" end="00:28:08.909" style="s2">Time&#39;s up.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.609" end="00:28:17.409" style="s2">See you tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.609" end="00:28:25.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, there&#39;s a banquet tonight. The</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.709" end="00:28:27.209" style="s2">master requests you prepare a banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:30.309" style="s2">The monthly gathering, representatives</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.209" end="00:28:32.509" style="s2">from all bloodlines will attend.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.309" end="00:28:34.910" style="s2">The terrace warmth still lingers, yet</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.509" end="00:28:36.510" style="s2">now I must face all of them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.910" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law, you look stunning</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.510" end="00:28:39.310" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.310" end="00:28:41.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.310" end="00:28:43.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; mind if I borrow your wife for a dance?</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.710" end="00:28:46.110" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s eager to see our new lady,</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.610" end="00:28:48.510" style="s2">sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.110" end="00:28:48.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.610" end="00:28:53.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you settling in, sister-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.110" end="00:28:55.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.310" end="00:28:57.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does my brother treat you well?</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.610" end="00:28:59.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We keep to ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.310" end="00:29:01.664" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That won&#39;t do. Your husband and wife,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.210" end="00:29:02.210" style="s2">you should get closer.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.664" end="00:29:04.410" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.210" end="00:29:06.210" style="s2">You&#39;ve been digging into Lilith&#39;s past.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.410" end="00:29:10.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m merely curious.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.210" end="00:29:11.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Curiosity killed the cat, sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.010" end="00:29:12.710" style="s2">Not screaming.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.110" end="00:29:15.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that what you want?</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.710" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m wondering how much you can take.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.610" end="00:29:20.010" style="s2">You know, Lilith was just as stubborn</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.610" end="00:29:22.110" style="s2">back then. It&#39;s a pity.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.010" end="00:29:24.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.110" end="00:29:24.810" style="s2">Brother, you misunderstand. I was just</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.010" end="00:29:27.410" style="s2">dancing with her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.810" end="00:29:29.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw everything.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.410" end="00:29:34.410" style="s2">You&#39;re hurting my wife at my banquet in</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.810" end="00:29:34.410" style="s2">front of everyone. Remember who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.610" end="00:29:42.610" style="s2">I was gone for 500 years, and some of</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.610" end="00:29:44.110" style="s2">you have forgotten the rules. Ever since</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.610" end="00:29:46.510" style="s2">my return, there have been people</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.110" end="00:29:47.910" style="s2">testing me, testing my limits, testing</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.510" end="00:29:51.710" style="s2">her place.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.910" end="00:29:51.710" style="s2">Let me make this clear today.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.810" end="00:29:57.710" style="s2">She is my wife, the lady of this estate.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.710" end="00:30:00.510" style="s2">She belongs to me. Anyone who takes</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.710" end="00:30:03.235" style="s2">issue with her can come to me directly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.510" end="00:30:03.910" style="s2">Anyone who schemes behind my back again,</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.235" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.910" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">I won&#39;t give a second chance.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.510" end="00:30:13.210" style="s2">Does your hand still hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.510" end="00:30:13.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.310" end="00:30:17.210" style="s2">What do we do? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.710" end="00:30:18.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.210" end="00:30:21.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he already</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.710" end="00:30:23.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years ago, he protected Lilith just</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.810" end="00:30:25.310" style="s2">like that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.310" end="00:30:27.010" style="s2">And look how that ended. The more he</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.310" end="00:30:29.410" style="s2">care,</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.010" end="00:30:31.110" style="s2">the harder he fall.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.410" end="00:30:33.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him protect her.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.110" end="00:30:34.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The tighter he holds on, the more</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.310" end="00:30:37.112" style="s2">entertaining</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.810" end="00:30:39.712" style="s2">the the will</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.112" end="00:30:39.712" style="s2">It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.212" end="00:30:43.412" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:48.912" style="s2">If anyone gives you trouble from now on,</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.112" end="00:30:50.012" style="s2">tell me immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.912" end="00:30:51.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can handle it on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.012" end="00:30:54.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you can, but you do not have to</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.912" end="00:30:57.012" style="s2">bear everything alone. You are my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.712" end="00:30:58.912" style="s2">To harm you is to defy me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.012" end="00:31:00.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.912" end="00:31:02.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest well.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.112" end="00:31:02.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.512" end="00:31:07.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The records here hold the most complete</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.312" end="00:31:08.612" style="s2">werewolf history, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.612" end="00:31:10.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.612" end="00:31:12.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These volumes document every major event</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.412" end="00:31:14.712" style="s2">on the estate over the past 500 years,</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.612" end="00:31:15.812" style="s2">including the sacrificial tradition.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.712" end="00:31:17.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are all handwritten?</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.812" end="00:31:18.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Every steward has the duty to keep</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.812" end="00:31:20.912" style="s2">records.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.412" end="00:31:21.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sacrificial tradition started 500</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.912" end="00:31:24.212" style="s2">years ago?</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.912" end="00:31:25.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, shortly before the master went into</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.212" end="00:31:26.712" style="s2">seclusion.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.212" end="00:31:28.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the very beginning, what happened to</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.712" end="00:31:29.812" style="s2">those girls who were brought here?</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.112" end="00:31:31.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Initially, Red hired them to work at the</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.812" end="00:31:33.012" style="s2">estate. They were free to leave if they</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.512" end="00:31:34.812" style="s2">wished.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.012" end="00:31:36.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cain didn&#39;t know about this?</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.812" end="00:31:38.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The master had just endured great loss</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.712" end="00:31:40.012" style="s2">back then and had no heart for estate</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.712" end="00:31:42.712" style="s2">affairs.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.012" end="00:31:44.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 450 years ago, skeletons discovered</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.712" end="00:31:46.312" style="s2">along the forest edge</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.512" end="00:31:48.712" style="s2">bearing werewolf bite marks. There were</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.312" end="00:31:50.012" style="s2">no such findings for the first 50 years.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.712" end="00:31:52.912" style="s2">Then bodies started appearing out of</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.012" end="00:31:54.812" style="s2">nowhere. What happened 450 years prior?</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.912" end="00:31:55.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The master was already in seclusion by</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.812" end="00:31:58.612" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.412" end="00:31:58.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who took over running the estate?</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.012" end="00:32:03.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young master Red.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.812" end="00:32:05.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cain leaves.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.512" end="00:32:07.812" style="s2">Bodies start showing up.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.912" end="00:32:08.612" style="s2">So it was Red, not Cain, preying on</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.812" end="00:32:10.612" style="s2">those people.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.612" end="00:32:13.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, there&#39;s no proof of this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.612" end="00:32:14.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I [snorts] have no evidence,</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.212" end="00:32:16.612" style="s2">but Red is the prime suspect. Let&#39;s get</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.812" end="00:32:19.112" style="s2">out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.612" end="00:32:20.787" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fine day for a hunt. Our new lady is</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.112" end="00:32:20.912" style="s2">welcome to join us.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.787" end="00:32:22.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.912" end="00:32:25.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A human tagging along?</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.912" end="00:32:27.112" style="s2">Don&#39;t go bursting into tears out there.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.372" end="00:32:29.612" style="s2">[snorts] Thanks for the concern. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.112" end="00:32:29.612" style="s2">manage.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.112" end="00:32:33.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ought to stay behind. The hunt holds</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.012" end="00:32:34.712" style="s2">too many dangers.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.212" end="00:32:36.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.712" end="00:32:39.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, you ought to respect her wishes.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.712" end="00:32:43.413" style="s2">Do not cage her simply for being human.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.413" end="00:32:44.113" style="s2">Stay close to me. Don&#39;t wander off.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.413" end="00:32:46.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.113" end="00:32:48.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.013" end="00:32:50.213" style="s2">Sister-in-law, take the left path.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.213" end="00:32:52.313" style="s2">There&#39;s more game that way.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.213" end="00:32:53.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you the lead hunter?</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.313" end="00:32:55.613" style="s2">Why split off?</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.513" end="00:32:58.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to look after the others.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.613" end="00:32:58.713" style="s2">Marcus will go with you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.813" end="00:33:01.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus, do you agree there is more game</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.513" end="00:33:04.313" style="s2">down that path?</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.513" end="00:33:04.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.513" end="00:33:09.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too quiet here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.013" end="00:33:11.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.013" end="00:33:14.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.113" end="00:33:14.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s [snorts] a stranger scent.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.713" end="00:33:25.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SOMEONE&#39;S HERE. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.913" end="00:33:25.013" style="s2">IVY.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.113" end="00:33:32.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE ARE YOU HURT?</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.313" end="00:33:32.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M FINE. THE ARROW, IT MISSED.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.213" end="00:33:36.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.413" end="00:33:38.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have any idea what you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.513" end="00:33:39.813" style="s2">I told [clears throat] you not to go.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.113" end="00:33:41.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to be left out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.813" end="00:33:42.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not a werewolf.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.013" end="00:33:43.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A single arrow could have ended your</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.413" end="00:33:45.313" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.713" end="00:33:47.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why must you be so reckless?</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.313" end="00:33:48.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t recklessness.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.113" end="00:33:49.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why wander off when I can&#39;t watch</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.713" end="00:33:50.813" style="s2">over you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.313" end="00:33:53.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I don&#39;t want TO BE THE DEAD</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.813" end="00:33:55.713" style="s2">WEIGHT FOREVER.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.013" end="00:33:58.613" style="s2">And Marcus was with me</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.713" end="00:34:01.013" style="s2">from the very day you brought me here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.613" end="00:34:03.213" style="s2">Every single person looks at me like I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.013" end="00:34:04.613" style="s2">dead weight, a useless human you have to</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.213" end="00:34:07.313" style="s2">save.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.613" end="00:34:08.913" style="s2">I wanted to prove I&#39;m not that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.313" end="00:34:10.413" style="s2">I wanted them to see I&#39;m capable</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.913" end="00:34:12.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prove yourself</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.413" end="00:34:14.313" style="s2">at the cost of your life?</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.113" end="00:34:16.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I don&#39;t stand up for myself, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.313" end="00:34:18.513" style="s2">always be that poor little human</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.113" end="00:34:19.613" style="s2">sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.513" end="00:34:20.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;d rather go and get yourself</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.613" end="00:34:21.713" style="s2">killed?</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.313" end="00:34:24.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t trying to get killed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.713" end="00:34:24.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you almost did.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:29.813" style="s2">Red set up that hunt.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.713" end="00:34:30.913" style="s2">He sent you down that path.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.813" end="00:34:32.113" style="s2">Can&#39;t you see that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.913" end="00:34:34.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.113" end="00:34:35.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you go?</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.013" end="00:34:36.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I wanted to know what he was</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.313" end="00:34:37.683" style="s2">planning.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.313" end="00:34:39.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now you know</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.683" end="00:34:41.514" style="s2">[clears throat] he wants to kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.313" end="00:34:44.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you knew he wanted me dead,</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.514" end="00:34:46.014" style="s2">why don&#39;t you just deal with him?</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.314" end="00:34:46.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Things are far more complicated than you</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.014" end="00:34:47.914" style="s2">understand.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.814" end="00:34:48.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Complicated how?</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.914" end="00:34:51.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t understand.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.914" end="00:34:54.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t understand? Or you just refuse</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.414" end="00:34:56.314" style="s2">to tell me? You hide everything from me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.314" end="00:34:57.914" style="s2">You won&#39;t speak of Lilith of Red or your</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.314" end="00:34:59.814" style="s2">curse.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.914" end="00:35:02.214" style="s2">You keep me in the dark and then you</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.814" end="00:35:05.014" style="s2">blame me for not knowing better.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.214" end="00:35:06.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.014" end="00:35:08.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Protect me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.814" end="00:35:11.314" style="s2">You think it&#39;s complicated because</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.114" end="00:35:11.314" style="s2">you&#39;ve never been straight with me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.674" end="00:35:20.259" style="s2">[snorts] I won&#39;t cry.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.314" end="00:35:22.114" style="s2">Not a single tear.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.259" end="00:35:26.114" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.114" end="00:35:26.114" style="s2">Cold, so cold.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.514" end="00:35:30.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pack&#39;s cold venom seeped into your</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.514" end="00:35:31.614" style="s2">body.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.714" end="00:35:33.359" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.614" end="00:35:35.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.359" end="00:35:35.379" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.914" end="00:35:40.414" style="s2">You?</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.714" end="00:35:41.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awake?</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:43.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.514" end="00:35:44.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had a fever last night.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.314" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.314" end="00:35:49.414" style="s2">stayed up all night watching over me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.214" end="00:35:50.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as the fever&#39;s broken.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.414" end="00:35:53.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.914" end="00:35:53.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.214" end="00:36:00.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of man is he, really?</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.014" end="00:36:05.314" style="s2">Can&#39;t sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.914" end="00:36:06.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t sleep either.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.314" end="00:36:08.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.414" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry about the other day.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.314" end="00:36:11.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.814" end="00:36:13.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was harsh.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.414" end="00:36:15.514" style="s2">I said you never tell me the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.714" end="00:36:16.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You weren&#39;t wrong. I haven&#39;t told you</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.514" end="00:36:17.314" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.214" end="00:36:18.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about now?</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.314" end="00:36:21.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want to know?</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:21.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you isolate yourself for 500</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.014" end="00:36:23.814" style="s2">years?</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.714" end="00:36:25.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To keep from hurting anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.814" end="00:36:27.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurt who?</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.414" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.314" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your curse, what exactly is it?</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.414" end="00:36:36.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.414" end="00:36:38.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lilith left it before she died. For 500</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.714" end="00:36:41.014" style="s2">years, any intense emotion sets it off.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.914" end="00:36:41.714" style="s2">Rage, grief, terror, it all triggers the</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.014" end="00:36:43.016" style="s2">mark.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.714" end="00:36:45.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happens when it&#39;s triggered?</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.016" end="00:36:47.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Loss of control, transformation,</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.616" end="00:36:49.716" style="s2">agonizing pain. That&#39;s why I have to</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.616" end="00:36:51.516" style="s2">suppress every feeling. I can&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.716" end="00:36:54.116" style="s2">myself feel anything strongly.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.516" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years all alone?</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.116" end="00:36:58.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.516" end="00:37:00.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s why you&#39;re always so cold?</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.316" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t mean to be.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.916" end="00:37:04.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.316" end="00:37:06.016" style="s2">But when I touch you, the mark feels</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.616" end="00:37:08.116" style="s2">different, doesn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.016" end="00:37:10.016" style="s2">Back in the study, the claw mark on your</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.116" end="00:37:11.116" style="s2">chest glowed. It didn&#39;t look like it</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.016" end="00:37:13.116" style="s2">hurt you then.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.116" end="00:37:14.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s different indeed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.116" end="00:37:15.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.316" end="00:37:16.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.216" end="00:37:18.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know?</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.916" end="00:37:19.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But there&#39;s a possibility.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.816" end="00:37:21.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What possibility?</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.916" end="00:37:23.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never mind. It&#39;s far too late. You ought</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.816" end="00:37:26.816" style="s2">to head back and rest.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.616" end="00:37:26.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What possibility?</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.216" end="00:37:30.516" style="s2">Elder,</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.316" end="00:37:31.916" style="s2">I need to ask you something.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.516" end="00:37:34.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.916" end="00:37:36.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there any old werewolf legend people</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.016" end="00:37:38.916" style="s2">born to ease another&#39;s suffering?</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.516" end="00:37:41.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What makes you ask that, my lady?</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.916" end="00:37:44.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I touch Cain, his claw mark doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.416" end="00:37:48.216" style="s2">hurt. He admitted it himself last night.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.916" end="00:37:48.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, please come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.016" end="00:37:57.516" style="s2">This is called a fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.616" end="00:37:59.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mate?</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.516" end="00:38:02.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every werewolf has one predestined mate</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.816" end="00:38:04.916" style="s2">in their lifetime. No restrictions on</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.316" end="00:38:07.016" style="s2">race or status. When fated mates draw</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.916" end="00:38:09.516" style="s2">near, they can feel their hearts beating</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.016" end="00:38:11.716" style="s2">as one. A touch from one can soothe the</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.516" end="00:38:12.516" style="s2">other&#39;s pain.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.716" end="00:38:15.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.516" end="00:38:15.816" style="s2">what if a werewolf&#39;s fated mate dies?</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.146" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.816" end="00:38:19.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A new one only appears once the old mate</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.616" end="00:38:21.016" style="s2">dies.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.016" end="00:38:22.416" style="s2">It could take decades, centuries, or it</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.016" end="00:38:23.816" style="s2">may never come at all.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.416" end="00:38:24.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cain&#39;s old mate</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.816" end="00:38:26.916" style="s2">was Lilith.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.616" end="00:38:28.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. 500 years after her death.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.916" end="00:38:29.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the first one who can ease his</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.116" end="00:38:31.116" style="s2">curse.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.516" end="00:38:32.816" style="s2">That can&#39;t be right.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.116" end="00:38:34.316" style="s2">This can&#39;t be real.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.816" end="00:38:36.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady,</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.316" end="00:38:38.516" style="s2">the master&#39;s mark flared up the night he</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.316" end="00:38:43.016" style="s2">brought you home. Your touch alone</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.516" end="00:38:43.016" style="s2">quieted. I suspected it even then.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.816" end="00:38:47.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.916" end="00:38:47.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mates,</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.316" end="00:38:48.517" style="s2">tell me</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.717" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; if it&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.517" end="00:38:51.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already know.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.617" end="00:38:53.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s possible.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.517" end="00:38:55.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Possible?</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.517" end="00:38:56.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the marking ritual can confirm it</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.517" end="00:38:57.917" style="s2">for certain.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.517" end="00:39:00.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is the marking ritual?</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.917" end="00:39:02.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mates exchange blood under a full</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.117" end="00:39:05.917" style="s2">moon to forge an eternal mark. From that</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.517" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">moment on, they are bound, life, death,</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.917" end="00:39:08.317" style="s2">and every sense between.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.317" end="00:39:10.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eternal?</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.317" end="00:39:12.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It requires both parties&#39; consent. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.417" end="00:39:13.617" style="s2">would never force you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.017" end="00:39:15.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t do that ritual.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.617" end="00:39:16.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.017" end="00:39:18.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine?</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.217" end="00:39:20.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you I wouldn&#39;t force you. The</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.117" end="00:39:22.217" style="s2">contract remains valid, and you&#39;re free</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.417" end="00:39:23.117" style="s2">to leave whenever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.217" end="00:39:26.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it?</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.117" end="00:39:26.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else do you want me to say?</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.542" end="00:39:29.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.117" end="00:39:33.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about your curse? What happens if</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.217" end="00:39:33.117" style="s2">your fated mate refuses the marking?</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.317" end="00:39:38.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The marking ritual only confirms if</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.617" end="00:39:39.417" style="s2">you&#39;re my fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.417" end="00:39:41.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.417" end="00:39:44.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The condition to break the curse isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.917" end="00:39:45.417" style="s2">finding the fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.217" end="00:39:48.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what is?</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.417" end="00:39:51.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being truly accepted by the fated mate,</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.017" end="00:39:53.817" style="s2">not out of a contract, pity, or a sense</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.017" end="00:39:56.717" style="s2">of duty. She has to choose</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.817" end="00:39:58.717" style="s2">to accept this monster freely.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.717" end="00:40:01.217" style="s2">Every part of me,</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.717" end="00:40:02.717" style="s2">my past, my curse,</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.217" end="00:40:04.717" style="s2">all my broken flaws.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.717" end="00:40:07.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is that the condition?</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.717" end="00:40:10.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lilith wove that rule into the curse.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.717" end="00:40:11.917" style="s2">She wanted me to suffer endlessly, since</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.017" end="00:40:14.617" style="s2">no one [clears throat] would ever truly</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.917" end="00:40:14.617" style="s2">accept me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.717" end="00:40:16.917" style="s2">She was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.217" end="00:40:19.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.917" end="00:40:21.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.017" end="00:40:22.917" style="s2">Kane, I won&#39;t give myself to you just</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.117" end="00:40:24.617" style="s2">because we&#39;re fated.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.917" end="00:40:25.017" style="s2">I still don&#39;t know nearly enough about</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.617" end="00:40:26.148" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.017" end="00:40:26.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.148" end="00:40:28.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.417" end="00:40:30.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But maybe one day</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.217" end="00:40:30.617" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.817" end="00:40:35.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, it&#39;s my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.717" end="00:40:37.417" style="s2">The Southern Border Patrol was missed</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.817" end="00:40:39.017" style="s2">for one night. Missed one night. Did</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.417" end="00:40:40.617" style="s2">anyone cross the border in that window?</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.017" end="00:40:43.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I&#39;ve already done three extra</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.617" end="00:40:45.117" style="s2">patrols. One month&#39;s pay forfeited.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.417" end="00:40:46.117" style="s2">Rewrite the patrol system and submit it</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.117" end="00:40:48.117" style="s2">to me in three days.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.117" end="00:40:49.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not banishing me, master?</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.117" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve served flawlessly for</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.918" end="00:40:54.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; years. One mistake can be mended. I</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.718" end="00:40:56.718" style="s2">won&#39;t keep useless hands, but I do not</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.718" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">discard loyal servants over one error.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.718" end="00:41:00.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way he treats his men, nothing like</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:03.018" style="s2">the bloodthirsty devil from all the</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.418" end="00:41:03.018" style="s2">stories.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.518" end="00:41:09.418" style="s2">The estate only grows roses. Wild</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.918" end="00:41:12.018" style="s2">flowers only bloom up in the back</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.418" end="00:41:12.018" style="s2">mountain.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.218" end="00:41:18.018" style="s2">Cain is such a fool.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.418" end="00:41:19.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young master Red, that [ __ ] has been</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.018" end="00:41:20.218" style="s2">acting strange lately.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.318" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strange how?</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.218" end="00:41:23.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way she looks at the master has</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:25.218" style="s2">changed. Yesterday, someone saw her</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:26.718" style="s2">staring at a bouquet of wild flowers in</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.218" end="00:41:27.918" style="s2">her room.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.718" end="00:41:29.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wild flowers?</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.918" end="00:41:33.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Picked from the back mountain. I think</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.718" end="00:41:36.018" style="s2">we both know who left them for her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.218" end="00:41:37.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mates. Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.018" end="00:41:38.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve known all along?</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.318" end="00:41:40.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I suspected it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.818" end="00:41:42.618" style="s2">His claw mark never flares up when she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.618" end="00:41:44.418" style="s2">near him.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.618" end="00:41:46.518" style="s2">What else could it be?</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.418" end="00:41:48.618" style="s2">Which means we can&#39;t let her live.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.518" end="00:41:50.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the assassination failed.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.618" end="00:41:52.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Far too clumsy.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:53.518" style="s2">One try was more than enough of that.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.609" end="00:41:56.218" style="s2">[clears throat] To deal with a fated</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.518" end="00:41:57.118" style="s2">mate, you need a smarter approach.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.218" end="00:41:59.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What approach?</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.118" end="00:42:03.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Plant doubt in her heart about Cain.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.318" end="00:42:03.418" style="s2">Make her true acceptance never happen.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.518" end="00:42:07.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your coat, I washed it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.818" end="00:42:09.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.518" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That day you said you wanted me to know</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.118" end="00:42:11.118" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:13.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.118" end="00:42:13.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me now everything about</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.018" end="00:42:16.718" style="s2">Lilith.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.918" end="00:42:17.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years ago, Lilith was my fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.718" end="00:42:19.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.718" end="00:42:21.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew she was my fated mate the moment</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.818" end="00:42:22.918" style="s2">I met her. I thought we&#39;d be together</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.618" end="00:42:25.359" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.918" end="00:42:25.918" style="s2">But she loved Red.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.359" end="00:42:28.218" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.918" end="00:42:30.518" style="s2">She got close to me on Red&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.218" end="00:42:31.918" style="s2">Being my fated mate was the perfect</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.518" end="00:42:33.218" style="s2">disguise for her.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.918" end="00:42:35.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did they want?</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.218" end="00:42:37.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The alpha throne, rule over all</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.218" end="00:42:39.118" style="s2">werewolves. They discovered that it if</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.218" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">the alpha&#39;s fated mate killed him with</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:42.818" style="s2">her own hands, the line of succession</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.518" end="00:42:45.318" style="s2">would break.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.818" end="00:42:46.718" style="s2">Red could seize power without pushback.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.318" end="00:42:47.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you uncovered their plot?</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.718" end="00:42:49.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.718" end="00:42:51.518" style="s2">I wanted to talk it out, give her a</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.318" end="00:42:54.720" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.518" end="00:42:56.520" style="s2">I asked to meet her deep in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.720" end="00:42:58.120" style="s2">I told her if she called off the scheme,</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.520" end="00:42:59.120" style="s2">I&#39;d pretend nothing happened.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.120" end="00:43:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what?</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.120" end="00:43:04.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She struck first. Her blade was laced</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.520" end="00:43:08.020" style="s2">with werewolf poison.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.020" end="00:43:10.020" style="s2">That poison is fatal to our kind.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.020" end="00:43:11.820" style="s2">I had no other choice.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.020" end="00:43:14.320" style="s2">In the struggle,</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.820" end="00:43:15.520" style="s2">I killed her by accident.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.320" end="00:43:17.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.520" end="00:43:21.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With her last breath, she pressed her</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.420" end="00:43:24.020" style="s2">palm straight over my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.120" end="00:43:26.620" style="s2">She cursed me to eternal loneliness,</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.020" end="00:43:30.020" style="s2">cursed anyone who grows close to me</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.620" end="00:43:30.020" style="s2">to die because of me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.120" end="00:43:34.920" style="s2">The only way to lift it is for someone</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.120" end="00:43:37.820" style="s2">to truly accept this monster I am. If</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.920" end="00:43:39.720" style="s2">not, I will suffer endlessly until my</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.820" end="00:43:43.720" style="s2">heart rots away.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.720" end="00:43:45.720" style="s2">500 years. The pain never fades, not</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.720" end="00:43:46.820" style="s2">even for a single day.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.720" end="00:43:49.855" style="s2">Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.820" end="00:43:50.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move, just for a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.855" end="00:43:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.520" end="00:43:53.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you afraid of me? I killed my</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.720" end="00:43:56.020" style="s2">fated mate.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.720" end="00:43:57.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You defended yourself. She betrayed you</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.020" end="00:43:58.920" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.320" end="00:44:01.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one else sees it that way.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.920" end="00:44:05.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what others think. All 500</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.620" end="00:44:05.620" style="s2">years, you endured this all alone?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.195" end="00:44:10.215" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.920" end="00:44:14.220" style="s2">I&#39;m here now.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.780" end="00:44:16.420" style="s2">[clears throat] Young master?</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.220" end="00:44:17.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re embracing each other.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.420" end="00:44:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.520" end="00:44:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go make preparations. Starting tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.920" end="00:44:22.920" style="s2">we play by new rules.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.520" end="00:44:24.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The library records state all the</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.920" end="00:44:25.420" style="s2">skeletons were uncovered around this</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.220" end="00:44:27.520" style="s2">area.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.420" end="00:44:28.920" style="s2">There has to be a clue here.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.520" end="00:44:30.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is anyone there?</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.920" end="00:44:31.420" style="s2">Please help me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.620" end="00:44:33.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.420" end="00:44:35.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name&#39;s Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.320" end="00:44:36.720" style="s2">I&#39;m just a traveling merchant. Is this</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.320" end="00:44:39.420" style="s2">private land?</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.720" end="00:44:40.520" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry. I had no idea.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.420" end="00:44:41.720" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave at once.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.520" end="00:44:43.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.720" end="00:44:44.020" style="s2">That wound will get infected if left</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.220" end="00:44:45.220" style="s2">untreated.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.020" end="00:44:46.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.220" end="00:44:48.320" style="s2">You&#39;re a kind soul.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.420" end="00:44:50.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wild animals roam around here often.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.320" end="00:44:53.520" style="s2">It&#39;s dangerous to travel alone.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.420" end="00:44:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just part of the merchant life.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.720" end="00:44:55.921" style="s2">Do you belong to the estate nearby,</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.921" end="00:44:57.021" style="s2">miss?</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.921" end="00:44:58.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could say that.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.021" end="00:44:59.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard the master of that estate is</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.421" end="00:45:02.021" style="s2">a terrifying man.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.921" end="00:45:04.321" style="s2">Have you met him?</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.021" end="00:45:05.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rumors aren&#39;t always true. He&#39;s not what</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.321" end="00:45:08.321" style="s2">they say.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.321" end="00:45:10.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sounds like you know him quite well.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.321" end="00:45:11.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to head back. Follow this trail</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.121" end="00:45:15.321" style="s2">and you&#39;ll hit the main road.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.421" end="00:45:15.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I hope we meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.621" end="00:45:19.021" style="s2">Not what they say?</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.321" end="00:45:20.321" style="s2">Soon enough, you&#39;ll learn the rumors</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.021" end="00:45:22.221" style="s2">were too kind.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.321" end="00:45:23.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane, I met an injured merchant at the</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.221" end="00:45:25.621" style="s2">edge of the forest today.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.821" end="00:45:26.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you never to wander the forest</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.621" end="00:45:27.921" style="s2">edge alone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.421" end="00:45:30.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not the point.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.921" end="00:45:32.521" style="s2">He had red hair, tall, spoke gently. He</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.821" end="00:45:35.321" style="s2">said his name was Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.521" end="00:45:39.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red hair? Were his eyes pale green?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.321" end="00:45:40.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. How did you know that?</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.021" end="00:45:42.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does he have an old scar across the</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.721" end="00:45:44.421" style="s2">webbing of his right thumb?</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.621" end="00:45:47.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He does. I wondered how a merchant would</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.421" end="00:45:47.221" style="s2">get a scar like that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.821" end="00:45:52.321" style="s2">That was Red.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.121" end="00:45:53.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That can&#39;t be him. He seemed so harmless</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.321" end="00:45:54.821" style="s2">and he was wounded.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.321" end="00:45:56.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what he wanted you to</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.821" end="00:45:59.121" style="s2">believe. He can alter his face at will.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.521" end="00:45:59.721" style="s2">Only his red hair and that scar never</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.121" end="00:46:01.621" style="s2">change.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.721" end="00:46:03.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He He approached me on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.621" end="00:46:05.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He put on the act of a kind stranger. Do</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.721" end="00:46:06.921" style="s2">you know what he&#39;ll do next? He&#39;ll feed</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.321" end="00:46:08.921" style="s2">you pieces of so-called truth about me</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.921" end="00:46:11.121" style="s2">all twisted and warped</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.921" end="00:46:12.821" style="s2">until you grow afraid of me, hate me,</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:14.721" style="s2">and push me away. TELL ME, WHAT DID HE</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.821" end="00:46:16.421" style="s2">SAY TO YOU TODAY?</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.721" end="00:46:17.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE ASKED IF I KNEW YOU WELL.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.421" end="00:46:20.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.821" end="00:46:20.421" style="s2">you say?</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.321" end="00:46:26.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said you&#39;re nothing like the rumors.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.921" end="00:46:28.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now he knows you trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.921" end="00:46:31.721" style="s2">Your trust is the very thing he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.521" end="00:46:31.721" style="s2">desperate to destroy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.321" end="00:46:37.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Red wants to get close to me, he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.021" end="00:46:37.421" style="s2">show up again. I need to get him to slip</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.121" end="00:46:38.721" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.421" end="00:46:40.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss,</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.721" end="00:46:41.721" style="s2">fancy meeting you again.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.621" end="00:46:43.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your legs healed?</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.721" end="00:46:45.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All thanks to your banding. Merchants</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.821" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">bounce back fast.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.221" end="00:46:48.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t left this stretch of forest</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:49.121" style="s2">yet?</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.017" end="00:46:50.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.121" end="00:46:52.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To be honest,</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.521" end="00:46:53.221" style="s2">I&#39;ve run into trouble. These forests</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.421" end="00:46:54.321" style="s2">aren&#39;t safe.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.221" end="00:46:55.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.321" end="00:46:56.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss,</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.321" end="00:46:58.323" style="s2">last time you said the estate master</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.921" end="00:46:59.323" style="s2">isn&#39;t what they say.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.323" end="00:47:00.622" style="s2">Do you truly know him?</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.323" end="00:47:02.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.622" end="00:47:04.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bought some old goods, found this</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.622" end="00:47:06.122" style="s2">letter. Look.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.723" end="00:47:08.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alpha Kane knows I&#39;ve discovered his</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.122" end="00:47:09.323" style="s2">secret. He will kill me. He is a</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.023" end="00:47:11.422" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.323" end="00:47:12.922" style="s2">He has killed everyone who trusted him.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.422" end="00:47:14.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I looked into it. Lilith was the</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.922" end="00:47:15.823" style="s2">master&#39;s old mate.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.223" end="00:47:18.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get this letter?</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.823" end="00:47:21.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An old hunter sold it to me. Said it was</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.223" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">passed down in his family.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.223" end="00:47:25.223" style="s2">500 years ago, a murder happened in</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.523" end="00:47:26.922" style="s2">these forest.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.223" end="00:47:28.922" style="s2">Legend says the estate master was a</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.922" end="00:47:30.523" style="s2">tyrant. He killed his own mate with his</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.922" end="00:47:33.122" style="s2">own hands.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.523" end="00:47:36.723" style="s2">After being cast out by his pack,</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.122" end="00:47:38.323" style="s2">he fled deep into the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.723" end="00:47:40.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That can&#39;t be right.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.323" end="00:47:42.223" style="s2">What he told me was nothing like this.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.823" end="00:47:44.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course he&#39;d make up a version that</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.223" end="00:47:46.023" style="s2">favors him.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.023" end="00:47:47.723" style="s2">Miss, I don&#39;t mean to frighten you, but</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.023" end="00:47:50.223" style="s2">living under his roof, you deserve the</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.723" end="00:47:50.223" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.922" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I keep this letter?</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.223" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. It was always meant for you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.622" end="00:48:03.023" style="s2">The seed is planted.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.122" end="00:48:06.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paper&#39;s genuinely aged.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.023" end="00:48:07.622" style="s2">The handwriting doesn&#39;t look fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.223" end="00:48:10.223" style="s2">But Kane said he was there when she</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.622" end="00:48:13.122" style="s2">died. She never left a suicide note.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.223" end="00:48:16.823" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask him face to face.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.122" end="00:48:16.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look dreadful. What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.622" end="00:48:24.823" style="s2">Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.922" end="00:48:26.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer me first. Is this real?</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.823" end="00:48:28.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is fake.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.323" end="00:48:30.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can you be so sure?</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.422" end="00:48:32.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was there when Lilith died. Her last</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.523" end="00:48:34.223" style="s2">words were only the curse.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.622" end="00:48:37.223" style="s2">She never wrote any letter.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.223" end="00:48:37.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you prove that?</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.323" end="00:48:40.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. There&#39;s no witness left to confirm</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.523" end="00:48:42.622" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.023" end="00:48:43.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you really kill her by accident?</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.622" end="00:48:45.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re doubting me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.823" end="00:48:47.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking for proof.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.023" end="00:48:50.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I TOLD YOU I HAVE NO PROOF, BUT SHE DIED</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.523" end="00:48:52.468" style="s2">RIGHT IN FRONT OF ME. I PERSONALLY</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.122" end="00:48:53.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Personally what?</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.468" end="00:48:55.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.422" end="00:48:57.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I killed her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.723" end="00:48:58.922" style="s2">I admit that,</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.122" end="00:49:00.323" style="s2">but she struck first.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.922" end="00:49:00.624" style="s2">I told you that.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.323" end="00:49:02.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You also</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.624" end="00:49:03.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; said you have no proof to back your</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.224" end="00:49:04.724" style="s2">story.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.603" end="00:49:06.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.724" end="00:49:07.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d rather believe a stranger than me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.124" end="00:49:09.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you NEVER TELL ME ANYTHING. I</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.724" end="00:49:09.624" style="s2">ALWAYS HAVE TO DRAG THE TRUTH OUT OF</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.124" end="00:49:11.424" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.624" end="00:49:12.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I TOLD YOU EVERYTHING THAT NIGHT ON THE</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.424" end="00:49:14.024" style="s2">ROOFTOP.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:16.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT NIGHT YOU TOLD me Lilith betrayed</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.024" end="00:49:18.924" style="s2">you, but this letter paints a completely</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.024" end="00:49:20.724" style="s2">different picture. You never fully</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.924" end="00:49:22.724" style="s2">You never fully explained why she even</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.724" end="00:49:26.924" style="s2">came near you in the first place.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.724" end="00:49:26.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I TOLD YOU SHE LOVED RED.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.224" end="00:49:32.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU SAID RED SENT HER TO MANIPULATE YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.324" end="00:49:34.524" style="s2">But how did she end up as your fated</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.924" end="00:49:36.424" style="s2">mate?</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.524" end="00:49:38.724" style="s2">AND WHY DOES HER PORTRAIT HANG IN THE</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.424" end="00:49:41.724" style="s2">DINING HALL?</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.724" end="00:49:42.624" style="s2">You never mentioned a word of that.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.724" end="00:49:44.324" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.624" end="00:49:45.324" style="s2">This is exactly what you do. You say</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.324" end="00:49:47.824" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.324" end="00:49:48.924" style="s2">Then you expect me to guess, to trust</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.824" end="00:49:50.724" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.924" end="00:49:52.224" style="s2">On what grounds?</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.724" end="00:49:53.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.224" end="00:49:54.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET GO OF ME!</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.024" end="00:49:57.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RED FORGED THIS LETTER. I SWEAR.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.924" end="00:50:01.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MEAN nothing to me. You can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.524" end="00:50:01.624" style="s2">give me a full, honest story.</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.424" end="00:50:09.104" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.824" end="00:50:10.124" style="s2">you&#39;ve crossed a line this time.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.104" end="00:50:12.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.124" end="00:50:13.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not that I don&#39;t believe him. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.324" end="00:50:15.824" style="s2">just</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.924" end="00:50:16.964" style="s2">terrified. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.824" end="00:50:18.984" style="s2">Where am I?</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.964" end="00:50:18.984" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.924" end="00:50:29.924" style="s2">Is anyone there?</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.424" end="00:50:38.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They didn&#39;t hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.424" end="00:50:38.924" style="s2">There&#39;s another reason they took me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.224" end="00:50:44.424" style="s2">It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.324" end="00:50:45.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me, Ryan, too. Sorry for the</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.424" end="00:50:48.924" style="s2">deception.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.724" end="00:50:50.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You forged that letter, too.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.924" end="00:50:52.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The letter is authentic.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.624" end="00:50:53.924" style="s2">I made up everything written on it, but</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.124" end="00:50:55.224" style="s2">the paper is indeed 500 years old.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.924" end="00:50:56.424" style="s2">Bought it from an antique dealer. Cost</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.224" end="00:50:58.424" style="s2">me a pretty penny.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.424" end="00:50:59.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want from me?</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.424" end="00:51:02.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no intention of hurting you</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.824" end="00:51:03.225" style="s2">truly. I just need one tiny favor from</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.325" end="00:51:04.425" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.225" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What favor?</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.425" end="00:51:07.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing at all.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.925" end="00:51:08.525" style="s2">Just stay here and wait.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.425" end="00:51:12.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait for what?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.525" end="00:51:12.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait for Kane to come rescue you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.725" end="00:51:16.325" style="s2">You know, Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.125" end="00:51:17.725" style="s2">you&#39;re special to him. 500 years and</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.325" end="00:51:19.725" style="s2">this is the first time I&#39;ve seen him</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.725" end="00:51:21.725" style="s2">like this over a human girl.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.725" end="00:51:23.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re using me as bait.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.725" end="00:51:25.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart girl. You&#39;re his fated mate. Once</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.925" end="00:51:27.425" style="s2">he knows you&#39;re here, he&#39;ll come without</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.325" end="00:51:28.525" style="s2">fail, alone, carrying that curse that</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.425" end="00:51:29.925" style="s2">can flare up any moment.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.525" end="00:51:31.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t come. He doesn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.925" end="00:51:32.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you honestly think he doesn&#39;t love</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.125" end="00:51:34.025" style="s2">you? My men have been watching the</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.325" end="00:51:35.425" style="s2">estate non-stop. He was beside himself</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.025" end="00:51:37.525" style="s2">with worry the second you ran off.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.425" end="00:51:40.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s been spying on us this whole time?</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.525" end="00:51:41.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Naturally. Ever since he returned. Get</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.025" end="00:51:42.425" style="s2">some rest. It&#39;s going to be a loud</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.925" end="00:51:43.725" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.425" end="00:51:46.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t kill him!</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.725" end="00:51:49.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps not, but he will die for you. Of</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:49.925" style="s2">that, I have no doubt.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.325" end="00:51:53.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane,</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.325" end="00:51:56.125" style="s2">don&#39;t come.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.725" end="00:51:58.490" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, the lady is gone. Her room is</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.125" end="00:51:59.025" style="s2">empty. The guards say she ran out.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.490" end="00:52:00.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.025" end="00:52:02.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long ago?</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.125" end="00:52:03.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 hours. Marcus took men out to comb the</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.225" end="00:52:04.725" style="s2">forest.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.125" end="00:52:05.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Southeast. Her scent fades off to the</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.725" end="00:52:06.925" style="s2">southeast.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.425" end="00:52:08.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, that stretch of forest holds</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.925" end="00:52:10.925" style="s2">Red&#39;s old hideout.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.925" end="00:52:11.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, this is clearly a trap.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.925" end="00:52:13.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.925" end="00:52:15.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least bring some men.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.425" end="00:52:18.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t meet me if I bring anyone. If I</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.525" end="00:52:20.225" style="s2">do, he&#39;ll kill her. Master, your curse.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.025" end="00:52:23.625" style="s2">Move. You&#39;re walking straight to your</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.225" end="00:52:23.625" style="s2">death. So what?</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.925" end="00:52:28.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Kane! Quickly!</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.625" end="00:52:35.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.125" end="00:52:35.025" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.325" end="00:52:40.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.625" end="00:52:44.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step aside. I don&#39;t want to kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.325" end="00:52:48.425" style="s2">Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.425" end="00:52:49.525" style="s2">wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.425" end="00:52:51.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.525" end="00:52:55.225" style="s2">He really came.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.025" end="00:52:55.225" style="s2">Fool, I told you not to come.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.131" end="00:52:58.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.825" end="00:53:05.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to take you home.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.336" end="00:53:05.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.827" end="00:53:12.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So touching. I&#39;m almost moved to tears.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.227" end="00:53:14.327" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.327" end="00:53:16.427" style="s2">do you honestly think</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.327" end="00:53:17.527" style="s2">you can take her away</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.427" end="00:53:21.027" style="s2">from here?</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.527" end="00:53:23.327" style="s2">12 guards plus red, strength at 40%. The</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.027" end="00:53:25.727" style="s2">curse could flare up anytime. Can&#39;t drag</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.327" end="00:53:25.727" style="s2">this out.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.327" end="00:53:31.127" style="s2">Cousin, look at you,</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.827" end="00:53:32.727" style="s2">all for a mere human girl.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.127" end="00:53:35.427" style="s2">Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.727" end="00:53:37.027" style="s2">You killed 14 guards alone.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.427" end="00:53:40.427" style="s2">I admire that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.027" end="00:53:43.327" style="s2">But how much strength do you have left?</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.427" end="00:53:44.727" style="s2">40%? 30? Your curse is flaring up, isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.327" end="00:53:47.727" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.727" end="00:53:47.727" style="s2">Just as I thought.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.227" end="00:53:52.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.527" end="00:53:54.127" style="s2">NOT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.027" end="00:53:54.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KANE.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.727" end="00:54:00.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 YEARS, COUSIN.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.927" end="00:54:00.227" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE still this weak.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.287" end="00:54:06.027" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.227" end="00:54:07.727" style="s2">You know, Lilith&#39;s curse has an</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.027" end="00:54:10.527" style="s2">interesting quirk.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.727" end="00:54:12.227" style="s2">The more you care, the fiercer it burns.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.527" end="00:54:13.727" style="s2">It feeds on your feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.227" end="00:54:15.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know that?</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.727" end="00:54:17.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lilith told me everything.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.727" end="00:54:20.527" style="s2">We planned it together.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.927" end="00:54:22.927" style="s2">Her love, her betrayal, every step was</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.527" end="00:54:24.327" style="s2">scripted.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.927" end="00:54:25.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the love</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.327" end="00:54:28.927" style="s2">was fake?</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.927" end="00:54:30.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From start to finish.</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.927" end="00:54:31.527" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.327" end="00:54:32.527" style="s2">Time to say goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.527" end="00:54:33.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.527" end="00:54:35.227" style="s2">KANE.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.527" end="00:54:36.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STAY STILL.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.227" end="00:54:36.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M SORRY.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.127" end="00:54:38.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.347" end="00:54:38.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.627" end="00:54:41.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT?</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.227" end="00:54:44.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FATED MATES.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.027" end="00:54:46.427" style="s2">LIVES bound together, hearts beating as</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.027" end="00:54:46.427" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.427" end="00:54:53.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grab her.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.412" end="00:54:53.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.027" end="00:54:58.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what this power is, but</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.327" end="00:54:58.127" style="s2">it&#39;s strong.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.327" end="00:55:03.858" style="s2">Kane, can you hear me? Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.203" end="00:55:05.878" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.858" end="00:55:05.878" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.327" end="00:55:06.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.827" end="00:55:07.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.928" end="00:55:10.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; talk.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.828" end="00:55:11.728" style="s2">Save your strength.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.408" end="00:55:14.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.728" end="00:55:15.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mark, the fated mate power awakened</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.228" end="00:55:17.928" style="s2">early?</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.528" end="00:55:19.628" style="s2">Impossible. Unless</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.928" end="00:55:21.128" style="s2">unless his love for her is already deep</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.628" end="00:55:23.728" style="s2">enough to trigger the instinctual</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.128" end="00:55:25.428" style="s2">protection.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.728" end="00:55:27.428" style="s2">AFTER THEM. THEY CAN&#39;T HAVE GONE FAR.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.428" end="00:55:29.528" style="s2">HIS CURSE IS STILL ACTIVE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.428" end="00:55:30.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PUT ME DOWN. YOU CAN BARELY HOLD on</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.528" end="00:55:33.028" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.428" end="00:55:33.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.918" end="00:55:39.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.193" end="00:55:42.928" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.503" end="00:55:45.778" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.928" end="00:55:47.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane, Kane.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.778" end="00:55:49.428" style="s2">[gasps] The curse is spreading.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.928" end="00:55:52.028" style="s2">If we don&#39;t stop it, it&#39;ll consume you</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.428" end="00:55:52.028" style="s2">entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.328" end="00:55:56.728" style="s2">You can&#39;t sleep. If you fall asleep now,</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.428" end="00:56:00.828" style="s2">you won&#39;t wake up. Do you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.728" end="00:56:00.828" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare give up. Promise me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.828" end="00:56:06.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t leave. I&#39;m not going anywhere. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.128" end="00:56:07.228" style="s2">right here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.128" end="00:56:09.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.228" end="00:56:11.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here. [laughter] I&#39;ve always been</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.128" end="00:56:11.428" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.633" end="00:56:14.653" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.328" end="00:56:24.128" style="s2">You&#39;re awake. How do you feel?</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.828" end="00:56:25.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like a hundred men took turns beating</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.128" end="00:56:28.528" style="s2">you senseless.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.028" end="00:56:28.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty much exactly what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.128" end="00:56:32.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.828" end="00:56:33.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.028" end="00:56:35.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got you captured.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.628" end="00:56:36.828" style="s2">You ran off because we fought.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.128" end="00:56:39.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I chose to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.828" end="00:56:40.628" style="s2">This isn&#39;t your fault, Kane.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.528" end="00:56:42.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.628" end="00:56:44.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.228" end="00:56:44.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.028" end="00:56:49.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, you&#39;ve rested long enough. We</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.628" end="00:56:50.928" style="s2">need to talk about what comes next.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.928" end="00:56:52.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What next?</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.928" end="00:56:54.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to help you uncover every last</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.628" end="00:56:57.728" style="s2">truth. The sacrifices, the bones, why</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.828" end="00:56:59.328" style="s2">you left 500 years ago, all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.728" end="00:56:59.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too dangerous. Red already knows you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.328" end="00:57:01.628" style="s2">my</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.628" end="00:57:04.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saved me once. Now it&#39;s my turn to</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.628" end="00:57:04.428" style="s2">stand by you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.328" end="00:57:10.129" style="s2">Those bones hold all the answers. If you</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.528" end="00:57:10.929" style="s2">aren&#39;t the one killing and someone</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.129" end="00:57:12.129" style="s2">else&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.929" end="00:57:13.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feeding on humans?</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.129" end="00:57:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Our town has a history of</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.729" end="00:57:17.729" style="s2">sacrifices. 50 girls over 500 years. I</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.429" end="00:57:18.629" style="s2">need to find out where this cruel</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.729" end="00:57:19.829" style="s2">tradition began.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.629" end="00:57:21.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You plan to go back to the town?</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.829" end="00:57:23.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In disguise. No one will recognize me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.729" end="00:57:26.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not. It&#39;s too risky.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.829" end="00:57:28.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you trust me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.329" end="00:57:28.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.229" end="00:57:33.129" style="s2">Did you hear? There was a huge commotion</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.829" end="00:57:35.329" style="s2">out in the forest last night.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.129" end="00:57:36.729" style="s2">Was it that man-eating monster?</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.329" end="00:57:39.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s spreading rumors about the</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.729" end="00:57:42.329" style="s2">werewolf.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.129" end="00:57:42.329" style="s2">Where did all these lies start?</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.329" end="00:57:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.029" end="00:57:50.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Granny Martha, I&#39;ve come to ask you</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.329" end="00:57:51.829" style="s2">something about the sacrifices.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.429" end="00:57:53.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.829" end="00:57:55.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who was sacrificed and came back</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.329" end="00:57:55.829" style="s2">alive.</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.529" end="00:58:02.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want to know?</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.729" end="00:58:04.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did this sacrifice tradition begin?</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.629" end="00:58:06.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.329" end="00:58:07.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were there bones from the beginning?</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.229" end="00:58:09.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you digging into this?</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.829" end="00:58:12.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, it&#39;s important.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.829" end="00:58:14.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. For the first 50 years,</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.429" end="00:58:17.029" style="s2">the sacrifice girls just vanished. No</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.629" end="00:58:18.829" style="s2">bodies, no bones, nothing at all.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.029" end="00:58:21.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then when did the bones start appearing?</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.829" end="00:58:23.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Around 450 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.329" end="00:58:24.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Granny Martha, of all the girls taken,</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.129" end="00:58:27.629" style="s2">has anyone ever made it back alive?</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.929" end="00:58:30.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a single one.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.629" end="00:58:30.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.929" end="00:58:34.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girl,</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.429" end="00:58:35.829" style="s2">whatever you&#39;re investigating, be</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.329" end="00:58:37.729" style="s2">carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.829" end="00:58:40.429" style="s2">There&#39;s more than one monster lurking in</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.729" end="00:58:40.429" style="s2">the woods.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.729" end="00:58:45.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bones only started turning up after</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.329" end="00:58:48.329" style="s2">Red seized power. Kane never harmed</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.329" end="00:58:48.329" style="s2">anyone before that.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.629" end="00:58:53.429" style="s2">Granny Martha was right. There&#39;s more</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.229" end="00:58:53.429" style="s2">than one monster in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.129" end="00:58:58.629" style="s2">Kane said Red&#39;s old hideout lies</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.729" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">southeast.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.629" end="00:59:02.329" style="s2">The dungeon&#39;s just a prison,</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.529" end="00:59:04.929" style="s2">but his study is where he hides all his</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.329" end="00:59:04.929" style="s2">secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.210" end="00:59:08.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.529" end="00:59:16.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.131" end="00:59:21.931" style="s2">37th girl,</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.731" end="00:59:23.031" style="s2">pure blood. My power surge lasted three</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.931" end="00:59:24.431" style="s2">days.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.031" end="00:59:25.931" style="s2">The effects are stronger than the last</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.431" end="00:59:28.531" style="s2">batch.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.931" end="00:59:32.131" style="s2">41st girl, too old.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.531" end="00:59:35.231" style="s2">50 girls, all eaten by Red. He framed</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.131" end="00:59:35.231" style="s2">Kane for this.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.831" end="00:59:46.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three days, still no trace.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.531" end="00:59:47.831" style="s2">Cursed Kane managed to what</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.231" end="00:59:51.131" style="s2">slip away.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.831" end="00:59:51.131" style="s2">A human scent.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.331" end="00:59:55.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red, we&#39;ve got news.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.731" end="01:00:03.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.431" end="01:00:07.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t recognize me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.631" end="01:00:09.531" style="s2">I I&#39;m here to see Red.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.931" end="01:00:10.631" style="s2">I&#39;ve got information about Kane to sell</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.531" end="01:00:11.931" style="s2">to him.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.631" end="01:00:14.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What information?</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.931" end="01:00:16.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spotted his trail deep in the forest,</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.031" end="01:00:19.331" style="s2">but I&#39;ll only talk to Red himself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.531" end="01:00:20.831" style="s2">He can name his price.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.331" end="01:00:22.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.831" end="01:00:24.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a village woman trying to make some</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.431" end="01:00:26.331" style="s2">coin.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.031" end="01:00:30.031" style="s2">Times are tough back in town.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.331" end="01:00:30.031" style="s2">Get out and don&#39;t let me see you again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.016" end="01:00:34.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.131" end="01:00:36.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.631" end="01:00:37.256" style="s2">Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.601" end="01:00:37.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.256" end="01:00:39.031" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.911" end="01:00:42.031" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.031" end="01:00:42.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read these for yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.731" end="01:00:53.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 450 years, 49 girls, all Red&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.331" end="01:00:55.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was meant to be the 50th.</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.731" end="01:00:57.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew he was rotten,</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.731" end="01:01:00.031" style="s2">but I never imagined he&#39;d prey on human</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.631" end="01:01:02.631" style="s2">villages like this. Are you certain?</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.031" end="01:01:04.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it with my own eyes. Every page</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.631" end="01:01:07.531" style="s2">was written by his hand.</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.931" end="01:01:09.831" style="s2">He killed and fed on those girls, not</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.531" end="01:01:09.831" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.031" end="01:01:18.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.331" end="01:01:20.432" style="s2">But never take such terrible risks alone</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.132" end="01:01:22.332" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.432" end="01:01:23.732" style="s2">Now it&#39;s time I fight back.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.332" end="01:01:25.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wounds haven&#39;t healed.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.732" end="01:01:27.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those girls can&#39;t wait.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.732" end="01:01:29.932" style="s2">I fear he&#39;ll do something even worse if</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.332" end="01:01:29.932" style="s2">we delay.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.732" end="01:01:41.632" style="s2">Come back to the estate with me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.932" end="01:01:44.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then?</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.632" end="01:01:46.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next I&#39;ll dig up every last bone Reds</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.032" end="01:01:49.632" style="s2">hidden away over 500 years and expose</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.632" end="01:01:49.632" style="s2">his crimes to everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.332" end="01:01:54.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, your wounds.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.532" end="01:01:56.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not dead yet.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.632" end="01:01:57.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gather everyone in the great hall.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.232" end="01:02:00.132" style="s2">Everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.132" end="01:02:00.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even Reds followers?</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.032" end="01:02:04.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Especially Reds.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.732" end="01:02:09.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, you drag everyone out while</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.832" end="01:02:12.232" style="s2">still injured. What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.532" end="01:02:13.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 450 years ago</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.232" end="01:02:16.832" style="s2">bones started turning up in these</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.832" end="01:02:19.732" style="s2">forests. Everyone blamed me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.832" end="01:02:19.732" style="s2">But it was all a lie.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.132" end="01:02:23.832" style="s2">This is Reds personal journal.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.032" end="01:02:24.732" style="s2">49 girls.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.832" end="01:02:25.532" style="s2">HE ATE THEM.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.732" end="01:02:27.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT?</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.532" end="01:02:30.532" style="s2">NO, IMPOSSIBLE.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.032" end="01:02:30.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Use their blood to strengthen himself.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.032" end="01:02:33.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, you know forging evidence is a</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.532" end="01:02:34.632" style="s2">crime, right?</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.232" end="01:02:36.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dare you claim these are forgeries?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.632" end="01:02:38.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, the handwriting bears a faint</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.532" end="01:02:39.832" style="s2">resemblance to mine. Yes, but who here</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.032" end="01:02:41.132" style="s2">can swear this was written by my hand?</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.832" end="01:02:44.432" style="s2">Who witnessed me penning words like</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.132" end="01:02:45.932" style="s2">these and who uncovered these pages?</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.432" end="01:02:48.132" style="s2">Her. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.932" end="01:02:49.732" style="s2">A human girl who&#39;s barely set foot on</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.132" end="01:02:52.632" style="s2">this estate two months.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.732" end="01:02:55.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do humans do best? Lie, stir up</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.632" end="01:02:56.632" style="s2">trouble, divide us. Has a single good</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.032" end="01:02:59.032" style="s2">thing happened on this land since she</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.632" end="01:03:01.332" style="s2">arrived? Cousin, this human has clouted</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.032" end="01:03:02.632" style="s2">your judgment. She&#39;s turning us brothers</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.332" end="01:03:04.832" style="s2">against one another.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.632" end="01:03:05.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The master&#39;s losing control.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.832" end="01:03:07.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.932" end="01:03:10.732" style="s2">Lose your temper in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.932" end="01:03:11.732" style="s2">Let them all see the real monster.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.732" end="01:03:13.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane,</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.732" end="01:03:14.232" style="s2">look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.148" end="01:03:16.832" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.232" end="01:03:19.033" style="s2">Calm down. If you attack now, you play</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.832" end="01:03:20.233" style="s2">right into his trap. That&#39;s exactly what</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.033" end="01:03:21.933" style="s2">he wants.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.233" end="01:03:24.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her touch alone calmed the curse, the</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.933" end="01:03:26.733" style="s2">power of a fated mate. It&#39;s far stronger</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.333" end="01:03:28.633" style="s2">than I ever imagined.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.733" end="01:03:30.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, so you really can&#39;t live without</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.633" end="01:03:33.333" style="s2">her? A single touch from a human and you</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.633" end="01:03:35.133" style="s2">calm right down. How touching.</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.333" end="01:03:35.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll make sure she disappears for</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.133" end="01:03:38.033" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.733" end="01:03:39.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This confrontation ends here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.033" end="01:03:42.433" style="s2">But the truth won&#39;t vanish just because</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.533" end="01:03:43.833" style="s2">he denies it. Elder, keep investigating.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.433" end="01:03:46.833" style="s2">I will make the culprit pay a terrible</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.833" end="01:03:46.833" style="s2">price for what he&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.333" end="01:03:53.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Set the next phase in motion.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.233" end="01:04:01.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That human forged the journal. Sneaky</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.833" end="01:04:01.833" style="s2">and deceitful.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.733" end="01:04:11.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oops.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.433" end="01:04:11.333" style="s2">My hand slipped.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.933" end="01:04:18.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold the bucket steady next time.</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.233" end="01:04:18.133" style="s2">Do I really need to teach you that?</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.933" end="01:04:25.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t belong here, human.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.133" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">Your blood might make our masters</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.633" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.333" end="01:04:33.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.833" end="01:04:36.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.933" end="01:04:39.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re blocking Kane&#39;s way.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.433" end="01:04:39.133" style="s2">Not thine.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.933" end="01:04:44.733" style="s2">The truth will come out.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.539" end="01:04:47.733" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.733" end="01:04:47.733" style="s2">You&#39;ll regret today.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.533" end="01:04:54.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red&#39;s rumors are spreading.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.133" end="01:04:54.933" style="s2">They splashed water on Miss Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.133" end="01:04:58.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was she hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.133" end="01:05:03.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, she handled it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.633" end="01:05:03.333" style="s2">Assign hidden guards. 10 ft max.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.533" end="01:05:09.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, we found three old followers</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.333" end="01:05:11.933" style="s2">from 500 years ago. They&#39;ll testify.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.933" end="01:05:14.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They saw Red return</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.933" end="01:05:14.933" style="s2">with blood back then.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.633" end="01:05:19.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring them in secret.</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.910" end="01:05:20.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.233" end="01:05:21.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long?</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.833" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.035" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to four days.</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.335" end="01:05:28.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In four days I end red.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.390" end="01:05:31.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.835" end="01:05:36.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t break down.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.285" end="01:05:39.035" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.135" end="01:05:40.525" style="s2">If I fall, he&#39;s alone.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.035" end="01:05:42.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.525" end="01:05:43.800" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.235" end="01:05:44.135" style="s2">Who did this?</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.800" end="01:05:47.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.135" end="01:05:49.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a bucket of water. No big deal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.135" end="01:05:49.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve assigned guards. It won&#39;t happen</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.235" end="01:05:51.135" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.835" end="01:05:53.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need bodyguards.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.135" end="01:05:53.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.135" end="01:05:57.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.335" end="01:06:02.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master,</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.335" end="01:06:04.235" style="s2">urgent word from the northern border.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.035" end="01:06:06.035" style="s2">Rogue werewolves raided our outpost.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.235" end="01:06:06.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rogue werewolves? Where did they come</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.035" end="01:06:08.235" style="s2">from?</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.535" end="01:06:09.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t know, BUT THERE ARE DOZENS OF</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.235" end="01:06:10.535" style="s2">THEM. THE OUTPOST WON&#39;T HOLD much</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.935" end="01:06:12.335" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.535" end="01:06:14.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The northern outpost is our only early</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.335" end="01:06:15.935" style="s2">warning line. If it falls, the rogues</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.335" end="01:06:17.235" style="s2">can march straight into our lands</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.935" end="01:06:19.235" style="s2">unimposed.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.235" end="01:06:21.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going myself.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.235" end="01:06:23.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, your wounds haven&#39;t fully No</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.135" end="01:06:23.635" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.735" end="01:06:27.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready the wolf riders.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.135" end="01:06:31.935" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back in two days.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.135" end="01:06:33.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you certain this intel is reliable?</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.935" end="01:06:35.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not sure,</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.135" end="01:06:38.835" style="s2">but I can&#39;t take that chance.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.235" end="01:06:38.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. I can take care of myself.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.235" end="01:06:48.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.935" end="01:06:55.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he just kiss me?</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.135" end="01:06:58.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.535" end="01:07:00.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The northern intel was fake?</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.935" end="01:07:02.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was real, of course. I simply paid</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.935" end="01:07:04.635" style="s2">them to attack.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.335" end="01:07:06.335" style="s2">By the time Kane figures out, he&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.635" end="01:07:08.135" style="s2">tricked.</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.335" end="01:07:10.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two full days will have passed.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.135" end="01:07:13.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is two days enough time?</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.935" end="01:07:13.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doubt me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.535" end="01:07:17.935" style="s2">The time to strike is now. Make all</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.235" end="01:07:20.435" style="s2">preparations.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.935" end="01:07:20.435" style="s2">Selena,</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.535" end="01:07:23.736" style="s2">do not fail this time.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.876" end="01:07:34.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.236" end="01:07:37.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just nerves.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.336" end="01:07:37.336" style="s2">I&#39;m too tense.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.036" end="01:07:46.136" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.036" end="01:07:46.136" style="s2">You left me no choice.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.561" end="01:07:53.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.436" end="01:07:55.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awake now.</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.136" end="01:07:56.536" style="s2">I measured the dose perfectly so you</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.036" end="01:07:57.436" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t sleep through everything.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.536" end="01:08:00.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is this?</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.436" end="01:08:02.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An ancient altar, 500 years old. Used to</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.436" end="01:08:05.636" style="s2">be for sacrifices to the gods.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.536" end="01:08:08.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight it&#39;s for me. Thinking Cain will</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.636" end="01:08:12.336" style="s2">save you? He couldn&#39;t even save Lilith.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.836" end="01:08:14.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one who killed Lilith.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.336" end="01:08:16.536" style="s2">You seduced her into betraying Cain,</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.836" end="01:08:18.536" style="s2">used her to cast the curse and made her</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.536" end="01:08:21.002" style="s2">the scapegoat. But Cain&#39;s carried your</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.536" end="01:08:22.736" style="s2">guilt for 500 years.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.002" end="01:08:25.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.736" end="01:08:27.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart, really, really smart. Where did</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.236" end="01:08:30.236" style="s2">Cain find you? Pity that clever Peter</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.636" end="01:08:32.136" style="s2">people rarely live long.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.236" end="01:08:34.536" style="s2">You know what fated mate blood is good</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.136" end="01:08:36.436" style="s2">for? A virgin&#39;s blood gives me three</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.536" end="01:08:38.936" style="s2">days of power.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.436" end="01:08:42.736" style="s2">Lilith&#39;s blood, cursed blood drenched in</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.936" end="01:08:45.536" style="s2">her agony, gave me 10 years. But you, a</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.736" end="01:08:47.836" style="s2">true fated mate, I&#39;m dying to see what</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.536" end="01:08:51.236" style="s2">heights your blood could push me to.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.836" end="01:08:54.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Touch me and Cain will tear you apart.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.236" end="01:08:54.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;d have to find you first.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.736" end="01:08:59.136" style="s2">And by the moment he does,</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.682" end="01:09:00.636" style="s2">[clears throat] you&#39;ll already be part</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.136" end="01:09:03.236" style="s2">of my power.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.636" end="01:09:05.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six gods, two on the left of the altar,</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.236" end="01:09:10.136" style="s2">two on the right, one at the entrance,</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.836" end="01:09:10.136" style="s2">and one standing beside Selena.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.336" end="01:09:14.536" style="s2">Selena,</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.036" end="01:09:17.936" style="s2">do you even know what kind of man you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.536" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">serving? He put you right in harm&#39;s way.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.936" end="01:09:22.136" style="s2">Did it ever cross your mind Cain might</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.736" end="01:09:23.836" style="s2">kill you? Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.136" end="01:09:26.336" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t love you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.836" end="01:09:27.938" style="s2">Power is all he cares about.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.336" end="01:09:30.237" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing more than a tool he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.938" end="01:09:32.038" style="s2">discard once you&#39;ve served your purpose.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.237" end="01:09:33.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know anything.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.038" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.737" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">How much have you done for him?</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.137" end="01:09:42.538" style="s2">Kidnapping, lying, killing. Has he ever</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.438" end="01:09:44.338" style="s2">said thank you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.538" end="01:09:45.737" style="s2">Has he ever once looked at you when you</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.338" end="01:09:48.637" style="s2">were hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.737" end="01:09:50.838" style="s2">It&#39;s not too late to stop.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.637" end="01:09:53.358" style="s2">Untime</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.838" end="01:09:54.438" style="s2">I won&#39;t tell Kane it was you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.358" end="01:09:55.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.438" end="01:09:56.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.038" end="01:09:58.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selena,</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.338" end="01:10:01.338" style="s2">ignore her empty words.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.438" end="01:10:04.637" style="s2">Humans are masters of deceit.</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.338" end="01:10:04.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does his hand carry blood?</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.738" end="01:10:08.637" style="s2">It does.</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.137" end="01:10:12.353" style="s2">The blood of 49 young girls.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.637" end="01:10:13.938" style="s2">He&#39;s fed on human flesh for 500 years.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.353" end="01:10:16.137" style="s2">[gasps] How can you sleep at night</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.938" end="01:10:17.438" style="s2">serving a monster like him? You owe him</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.137" end="01:10:20.038" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.438" end="01:10:21.938" style="s2">All he&#39;s ever given you is exploitation,</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.038" end="01:10:24.938" style="s2">but you can choose not to be his next</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.938" end="01:10:24.938" style="s2">disposable tool.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.338" end="01:10:30.938" style="s2">Kane, he figured out the trap.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.438" end="01:10:32.137" style="s2">He&#39;s coming back.</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.938" end="01:10:33.137" style="s2">You&#39;re scared.</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.137" end="01:10:35.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.137" end="01:10:37.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you afraid of? That Kane will</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.038" end="01:10:38.938" style="s2">kill you or that Red finding out you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.137" end="01:10:41.137" style="s2">wavering?</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.938" end="01:10:43.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.137" end="01:10:46.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m giving you one last chance.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.538" end="01:10:47.938" style="s2">He murdered 49 girls and you helped him</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.137" end="01:10:49.238" style="s2">bind the 50th.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.938" end="01:10:51.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They volunteered for the sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.238" end="01:10:53.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Volunteered? I&#39;m tied up here. Where&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.238" end="01:10:56.338" style="s2">my choice? Do you think he loves you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.838" end="01:10:57.338" style="s2">He schemed against his cousin for 500</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.338" end="01:10:58.738" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.338" end="01:10:59.838" style="s2">What could you ever be to him?</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.738" end="01:11:00.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selena,</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.838" end="01:11:01.838" style="s2">come here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.538" end="01:11:02.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What were you whispering to her just</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.838" end="01:11:04.099" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.738" end="01:11:04.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s begging.</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.099" end="01:11:05.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.238" end="01:11:07.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Begging?</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.438" end="01:11:10.137" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t strike me as the type.</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.438" end="01:11:10.838" style="s2">Your heart&#39;s softening, isn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.137" end="01:11:14.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.838" end="01:11:16.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look me in the eyes and say it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.538" end="01:11:18.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t go soft.</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.238" end="01:11:21.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Kane&#39;s almost here. When he comes</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.938" end="01:11:23.938" style="s2">in, you&#39;re in charge of the human.</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.938" end="01:11:24.738" style="s2">Don&#39;t let her escape.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.938" end="01:11:28.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.738" end="01:11:28.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what happens if she escapes?</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.538" end="01:11:30.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.539" end="01:11:36.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.439" end="01:11:36.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EVERYONE, WELCOME OUR ALPHA.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.839" end="01:11:42.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET HER GO.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.539" end="01:11:46.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STAY RIGHT THERE. TAKE ONE STEP FORWARD</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.839" end="01:11:46.439" style="s2">AND I&#39;LL SLICE HER THROAT OPEN.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.539" end="01:11:52.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S IT. LOSE CONTROL. If you give in</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.139" end="01:11:54.739" style="s2">to your rage, I&#39;ll have every excuse.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.139" end="01:11:56.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane, look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.739" end="01:11:59.739" style="s2">He won&#39;t kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.439" end="01:12:01.239" style="s2">I&#39;m his only leverage. Stay calm.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.739" end="01:12:03.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cannot kill her.</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.239" end="01:12:06.639" style="s2">Can&#39;t I? The blade&#39;s right in my hand</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.639" end="01:12:09.139" style="s2">because she is my fated mate.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.639" end="01:12:11.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fated mates, life bound to life falls on</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.139" end="01:12:13.939" style="s2">me. Any wound on her, my strength</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.439" end="01:12:16.939" style="s2">shields her in turn. To harm her is to</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.939" end="01:12:18.939" style="s2">harm me. If you slay her, even if I die,</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.939" end="01:12:21.039" style="s2">I&#39;ll drag you down with me. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.939" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">win.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.039" end="01:12:26.739" style="s2">Keep a close watch on her. A fated mate,</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.539" end="01:12:30.539" style="s2">perfect. I&#39;ll kill you first and your</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.739" end="01:12:30.539" style="s2">fated mate&#39;s power will be mine.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.939" end="01:12:40.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane&#39;s movements are slower than usual.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.939" end="01:12:42.939" style="s2">He&#39;s holding back his rage. The curse</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.539" end="01:12:44.739" style="s2">still lingers.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.939" end="01:12:47.239" style="s2">He can&#39;t go all out or he&#39;ll lose</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.739" end="01:12:47.239" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.830" end="01:12:56.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.739" end="01:12:58.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years, cousin.</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.339" end="01:13:01.739" style="s2">You&#39;ve always fought like this,</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.139" end="01:13:05.039" style="s2">hesitant, scared of everything.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.739" end="01:13:05.039" style="s2">Spare me your rambling.</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.639" end="01:13:13.239" style="s2">Your strength&#39;s fading.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.139" end="01:13:13.239" style="s2">The curse is eating away at you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.239" end="01:13:16.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KANE,</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.939" end="01:13:18.430" style="s2">NO.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.410" end="01:13:18.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.439" end="01:13:25.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S OVER, COUSIN.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.539" end="01:13:27.839" style="s2">YOU COULDN&#39;T BEAT ME 500 years ago</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.739" end="01:13:30.139" style="s2">and you won&#39;t beat me today.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.839" end="01:13:30.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO. LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.139" end="01:13:32.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE CAN do this to</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.940" end="01:13:35.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; own cousin.</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.540" end="01:13:35.240" style="s2">What am I to him?</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.740" end="01:13:42.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. I don&#39;t want to be his tool anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.040" end="01:13:44.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have died 500 years ago. The</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.340" end="01:13:47.740" style="s2">years you got after that,</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.540" end="01:13:47.740" style="s2">I gave them to you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.540" end="01:13:55.540" style="s2">Move aside</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.340" end="01:13:55.540" style="s2">or I&#39;ll kill you too.</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.840" end="01:14:02.440" style="s2">Run. Leave me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.140" end="01:14:03.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.440" end="01:14:03.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll die.</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.571" end="01:14:06.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.840" end="01:14:08.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we die together.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.340" end="01:14:11.440" style="s2">Listen to me, Kane.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.540" end="01:14:14.040" style="s2">I&#39;ll only say this once.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.440" end="01:14:16.440" style="s2">I&#39;m not afraid of you, not your claws,</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.040" end="01:14:18.940" style="s2">not your wolf form, not your 500 year</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.440" end="01:14:21.040" style="s2">curse. Whether you&#39;re human or beast,</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.940" end="01:14:24.140" style="s2">you&#39;re still Kane.</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.040" end="01:14:24.140" style="s2">You&#39;re still my husband.</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.840" end="01:14:30.240" style="s2">I accept you,</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.540" end="01:14:32.640" style="s2">all of you, your past, your wounds, your</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.240" end="01:14:35.040" style="s2">darkness, every part of you. I want all</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.640" end="01:14:35.040" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.040" end="01:14:40.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell?</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.340" end="01:14:50.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.840" end="01:14:50.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you, I accept you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.240" end="01:14:57.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It can&#39;t be. IT&#39;S IMPOSSIBLE. THAT CURSE</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.940" end="01:15:00.040" style="s2">CAN&#39;T BE LIFTED. LILITH SAID NO ONE</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.340" end="01:15:00.040" style="s2">COULD EVER.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.487" end="01:15:06.507" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.340" end="01:15:13.540" style="s2">DON&#39;T PUT ON A SHOW. YOU JUST broke the</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.540" end="01:15:13.540" style="s2">curse. Your body hasn&#39;t recovered yet.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.040" end="01:15:19.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is his true power. I can&#39;t imagine</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.740" end="01:15:21.240" style="s2">how strong he is without the curse</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.940" end="01:15:24.240" style="s2">holding him back.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.240" end="01:15:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years you manipulated Lilith.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.240" end="01:15:28.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You plotted betrayal.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.440" end="01:15:30.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ate 49 girls and made me carry the</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.040" end="01:15:32.340" style="s2">blame for five centuries.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.340" end="01:15:34.542" style="s2">She did what Lilith never could. Lilith</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.340" end="01:15:36.042" style="s2">never truly accepted me. She loved your</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.542" end="01:15:40.542" style="s2">lies.</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.042" end="01:15:42.542" style="s2">But Ivy I loves the real me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.542" end="01:15:44.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill me then. GO AHEAD. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.542" end="01:15:47.142" style="s2">KILL ME AND YOU&#39;RE JUST AS MUCH A</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.242" end="01:15:49.242" style="s2">monster as I am.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.142" end="01:15:53.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.242" end="01:15:53.642" style="s2">Death would be far too merciful for you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.542" end="01:16:00.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MASTER, WE&#39;RE SORRY WE&#39;RE LATE.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.142" end="01:16:00.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right on time for the judgment.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.842" end="01:16:05.142" style="s2">Bind Red</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.142" end="01:16:05.142" style="s2">silver chains.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.842" end="01:16:14.642" style="s2">First crime, over four centuries he</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.442" end="01:16:16.842" style="s2">devoured 49 girls, his own harvest logs.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.642" end="01:16:17.642" style="s2">Second crime, he manipulated Lillet,</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.842" end="01:16:19.742" style="s2">betrayed me</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.642" end="01:16:22.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and pinned every crime on my shoulder.</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.742" end="01:16:24.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Words. We have proof right here. I saw</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.642" end="01:16:27.542" style="s2">Red take Lillet to the forest. Then</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.742" end="01:16:30.042" style="s2">Kane&#39;s LAIR WAS DESTROYED. I SAW RED&#39;S</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.542" end="01:16:31.942" style="s2">CONVOY HAULING SQUIRMING SACKS INTO THE</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.042" end="01:16:34.142" style="s2">WOODS.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.942" end="01:16:36.642" style="s2">I WAS HIS SERVANT. I SAVED THIS LETTER</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.142" end="01:16:36.642" style="s2">FROM LILLET.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.542" end="01:16:42.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RED, I did everything. You promised to</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.942" end="01:16:44.342" style="s2">take me away, Lillet.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.942" end="01:16:46.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FORGERIES.</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.342" end="01:16:48.542" style="s2">EVERY LAST ONE OF THESE IS FAKE.</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.042" end="01:16:52.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WITNESSES, his journal, Lillet&#39;s letter.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.542" end="01:16:52.142" style="s2">Anyone still have doubts?</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.342" end="01:16:58.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years of accounts</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.342" end="01:17:00.742" style="s2">settled today.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.042" end="01:17:00.742" style="s2">You decide.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.042" end="01:17:04.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill him?</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.342" end="01:17:06.742" style="s2">That&#39;s too easy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.142" end="01:17:08.842" style="s2">Let him live locked with silver chains</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.742" end="01:17:09.942" style="s2">forever. Let him hear every day how</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.842" end="01:17:11.642" style="s2">happy we are.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.942" end="01:17:12.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JUST KILL ME.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.642" end="01:17:17.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that?</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.742" end="01:17:17.142" style="s2">He&#39;s rattled. That&#39;s exactly right.</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.242" end="01:17:19.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your call.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.342" end="01:17:24.042" style="s2">Get up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.042" end="01:17:26.442" style="s2">I said get up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.042" end="01:17:28.842" style="s2">I know who truly served Red and who was</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.442" end="01:17:31.142" style="s2">forced. You three spread the rumors. You</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.842" end="01:17:33.842" style="s2">planned the kidnapping. Silver chains,</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.142" end="01:17:34.942" style="s2">life imprisonment, same as Red. The rest</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.842" end="01:17:36.642" style="s2">of you</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.942" end="01:17:39.843" style="s2">I won&#39;t pursue it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.642" end="01:17:42.243" style="s2">Starting there are no men of red or can,</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.843" end="01:17:44.543" style="s2">only people of this estate.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.243" end="01:17:45.843" style="s2">Anyone who harbors disloyalty will share</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.543" end="01:17:48.643" style="s2">THEIR FATE.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.843" end="01:17:51.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE SWEAR OUR LOYALTY.</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.643" end="01:17:54.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MARCUS, MASTER, I stayed neutral before.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.943" end="01:17:56.543" style="s2">I make no excuses, but today I follow</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.543" end="01:17:59.143" style="s2">the true alpha, not out of fear, but</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.543" end="01:18:00.743" style="s2">because you deserve it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.143" end="01:18:03.743" style="s2">You saved Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.743" end="01:18:06.143" style="s2">I will not forget that.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.743" end="01:18:08.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not ask for forgiveness. I</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.143" end="01:18:10.643" style="s2">kidnapped you, lied to you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.643" end="01:18:13.343" style="s2">But in the end, you cut the rope. That</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.643" end="01:18:15.643" style="s2">is not enough to atone. No.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.343" end="01:18:18.543" style="s2">But it&#39;s enough to let you walk away.</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.643" end="01:18:18.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remove the chains.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.343" end="01:18:24.643" style="s2">Leave the estate, leave our territory,</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.743" end="01:18:24.643" style="s2">and never come back.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.143" end="01:18:28.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not going to kill me?</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.843" end="01:18:32.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saved her life.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.543" end="01:18:32.543" style="s2">That cancels your debt, but that&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.643" end="01:18:38.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red&#39;s locked away, Selena&#39;s gone, so</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.643" end="01:18:39.743" style="s2">what&#39;s next?</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.674" end="01:18:41.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.743" end="01:18:43.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.543" end="01:18:45.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.343" end="01:18:47.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me to Blackwood Town.</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.224" end="01:18:47.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.943" end="01:18:52.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that the mayor&#39;s daughter? I</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.943" end="01:18:55.643" style="s2">thought she was dead.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.543" end="01:19:00.043" style="s2">Look, ALPHA KANE.</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.643" end="01:19:00.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LORD KANE, what brings you here?</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.643" end="01:19:03.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you recognize me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.743" end="01:19:09.943" style="s2">I am Ivy Blackwood,</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.043" end="01:19:12.043" style="s2">the 50th sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.943" end="01:19:16.143" style="s2">You sent girls to the forest, but there</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.043" end="01:19:18.630" style="s2">is no monster. Red devoured them all.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.143" end="01:19:19.143" style="s2">Here is his diary.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.630" end="01:19:20.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.143" end="01:19:22.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS A FORGED TRICK.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.943" end="01:19:25.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FORGED?</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.143" end="01:19:25.143" style="s2">Read Lilith&#39;s letter.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.543" end="01:19:32.343" style="s2">Red betrayed Kane and cursed him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.043" end="01:19:34.143" style="s2">Kane never hurt anyone. He set us free.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.343" end="01:19:35.843" style="s2">They are alive.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.143" end="01:19:38.943" style="s2">Kane protected them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.843" end="01:19:41.144" style="s2">Red is in prison now. Your tradition,</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.943" end="01:19:43.945" style="s2">your tradition is a lie. You only cared</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.144" end="01:19:43.945" style="s2">about power.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.244" end="01:19:47.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.445" end="01:19:53.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.744" end="01:19:57.744" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.945" end="01:20:00.244" style="s2">I know I failed you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.744" end="01:20:02.244" style="s2">Sending you to the sacrifices</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.244" end="01:20:04.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say another word.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.244" end="01:20:06.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my daughter. Blood ties can never</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.844" end="01:20:09.644" style="s2">be broken.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.644" end="01:20:12.244" style="s2">We could start over.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.644" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The day you sent me to the forest, my</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.244" end="01:20:16.545" style="s2">father died.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.744" end="01:20:18.545" style="s2">I didn&#39;t come here to reconcile with</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.545" end="01:20:19.744" style="s2">family. I came so the living know the</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.545" end="01:20:21.945" style="s2">truth</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.744" end="01:20:24.144" style="s2">and the dead can rest.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.945" end="01:20:27.445" style="s2">Save your apologies. They are as empty</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.144" end="01:20:27.445" style="s2">as that stone monument.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.244" end="01:20:33.644" style="s2">Never speak my name again. You have no</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.244" end="01:20:33.644" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.885" end="01:20:39.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.445" end="01:20:45.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.744" end="01:20:45.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, home.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.445" end="01:20:53.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can see Blackwood Town from here.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.844" end="01:20:54.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.606" end="01:20:55.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.045" end="01:20:58.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you stand right here watching all</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.945" end="01:20:59.445" style="s2">those girls get sent into the forest 500</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.244" end="01:21:03.545" style="s2">years ago?</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.445" end="01:21:05.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every single time, every single girl.</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.545" end="01:21:07.545" style="s2">Ivy,</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.445" end="01:21:09.644" style="s2">I&#39;ve lived a thousand years. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.545" end="01:21:11.644" style="s2">witnessed endless wars, betrayals,</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.644" end="01:21:14.045" style="s2">death. I thought nothing would ever stir</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.644" end="01:21:15.445" style="s2">my heart again. I never imagined I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.045" end="01:21:16.545" style="s2">fall for a human.</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.445" end="01:21:19.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does that mean?</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.545" end="01:21:19.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It means</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.945" end="01:21:28.844" style="s2">you&#39;re the first.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.445" end="01:21:31.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first in a thousand years?</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.844" end="01:21:31.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the last.</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.945" end="01:21:33.644" style="s2">Ivy,</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.144" end="01:21:35.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes?</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.644" end="01:21:37.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; will you complete the mating mark ritual</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.545" end="01:21:38.644" style="s2">with me?</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.244" end="01:21:40.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mating mark, isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.644" end="01:21:41.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The final rite for fated mates. Once</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.545" end="01:21:44.046" style="s2">done, we will be bound as one,</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.845" end="01:21:46.745" style="s2">unbreakable. No contracts, no terms, no</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.046" end="01:21:48.546" style="s2">expiration for all our lives. But I need</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.745" end="01:21:50.446" style="s2">you to choose this freely,</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.546" end="01:21:52.245" style="s2">not out of obligation, gratitude, or</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.446" end="01:21:54.446" style="s2">some bargain, only because you want to</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.245" end="01:21:57.146" style="s2">be with me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.446" end="01:21:57.146" style="s2">Your choice.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.946" end="01:22:00.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How old are these runes?</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.546" end="01:22:02.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Older than me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.946" end="01:22:04.646" style="s2">Every generation of the wolves&#39; fated</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.845" end="01:22:05.546" style="s2">mates has performed the ritual right</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.646" end="01:22:08.646" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.546" end="01:22:09.345" style="s2">One final chance to back out.</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.646" end="01:22:11.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.345" end="01:22:13.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mating ritual, once it&#39;s done, the</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.745" end="01:22:15.046" style="s2">bond is permanent.</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.345" end="01:22:16.745" style="s2">You&#39;ll gain a long lifespan, not</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.046" end="01:22:19.646" style="s2">immortal, but far beyond a normal</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.745" end="01:22:22.046" style="s2">human&#39;s. You&#39;ll feel all my emotions</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.646" end="01:22:24.345" style="s2">since my location,</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.046" end="01:22:26.345" style="s2">no matter how far apart we are.</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.345" end="01:22:29.845" style="s2">And I&#39;ll feel every single part of you,</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.345" end="01:22:32.646" style="s2">too. No secrets, no hiding anything. Can</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.845" end="01:22:36.046" style="s2">you accept all of that?</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.646" end="01:22:39.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 years ago, Lilith hated being bound.</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.046" end="01:22:39.646" style="s2">She chose betrayal instead.</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.245" end="01:22:45.845" style="s2">But I&#39;m different.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.646" end="01:22:48.345" style="s2">All my life, no one ever needed me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.845" end="01:22:52.146" style="s2">My father treated me like a tool.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.345" end="01:22:53.946" style="s2">The town treated me like a sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.146" end="01:22:56.146" style="s2">When I was sent to the estate, I thought</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.946" end="01:22:58.646" style="s2">I was just a thing, something to be</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.146" end="01:23:00.345" style="s2">traded. But you were the first person</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.646" end="01:23:03.446" style="s2">who looked me in the eye</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.345" end="01:23:03.446" style="s2">and said you needed me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.345" end="01:23:10.745" style="s2">Not my blood, not my body as a tool.</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.446" end="01:23:13.046" style="s2">You can need me, just Ivy, the girl I</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.745" end="01:23:15.946" style="s2">am. I&#39;m sure of this. Not out of</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.046" end="01:23:17.245" style="s2">impulse, not out of gratitude. I want to</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.946" end="01:23:19.745" style="s2">be with you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.245" end="01:23:19.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.046" end="01:23:41.345" style="s2">I can feel you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.946" end="01:23:44.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does it feel like?</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.345" end="01:23:45.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like a steady fire. It doesn&#39;t burn, but</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.347" end="01:23:47.347" style="s2">it&#39;s always there.</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.247" end="01:23:50.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s our connection. You can feel</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.347" end="01:23:53.747" style="s2">every emotion inside me now.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.347" end="01:23:53.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what are you thinking right now?</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.547" end="01:24:03.747" style="s2">Does it still hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.947" end="01:24:06.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Nothing. 500 years. It&#39;s finally</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.747" end="01:24:08.747" style="s2">gone. But I can feel you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.947" end="01:24:10.247" style="s2">Your heartbeat, your warmth.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.747" end="01:24:13.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this all from the mating mark?</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.247" end="01:24:15.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Our lives are bound together.</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.147" end="01:24:16.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you crying?</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.247" end="01:24:20.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dust got in my eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.447" end="01:24:22.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liar. You&#39;re crying.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.147" end="01:24:23.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caught me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.147" end="01:24:24.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.347" end="01:24:26.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back to sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.947" end="01:24:27.447" style="s2">Big day tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.147" end="01:24:29.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What big day?</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.447" end="01:24:29.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making sure everyone knows you&#39;re my</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.147" end="01:24:31.778" style="s2">Luna.</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.758" end="01:24:31.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.947" end="01:24:35.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, the coronation is set in three</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.947" end="01:24:37.347" style="s2">days?</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.847" end="01:24:38.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, enough time?</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.347" end="01:24:39.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Plenty.</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.547" end="01:24:40.647" style="s2">But there&#39;s an issue.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.847" end="01:24:42.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.647" end="01:24:44.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two of the five elders are Red&#39;s men.</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.647" end="01:24:45.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll stir up trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.447" end="01:24:47.047" style="s2">Let them come.</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.247" end="01:24:49.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.047" end="01:24:52.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them rebel in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.547" end="01:24:55.647" style="s2">I&#39;ll finish this. Understood. Spread the</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.547" end="01:24:56.647" style="s2">word. Everyone must attend. Absentees</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.647" end="01:24:59.447" style="s2">are traitors.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.647" end="01:24:59.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, master.</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.647" end="01:25:04.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, the master sent these fabrics.</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.047" end="01:25:04.547" style="s2">Which one?</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.547" end="01:25:10.547" style="s2">This white one. White? Luna usually</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.147" end="01:25:11.847" style="s2">wears silver or black. I&#39;m human. White</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.547" end="01:25:12.847" style="s2">is fitting.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.847" end="01:25:14.147" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.847" end="01:25:18.147" style="s2">a problem?</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.147" end="01:25:18.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, my lady. I&#39;ll get the tailor.</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.647" end="01:25:25.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In three days, I&#39;ll be the Luna.</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.247" end="01:25:28.647" style="s2">Don&#39;t be nervous. You&#39;ve come this far.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.747" end="01:25:31.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s happening in three days?</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.647" end="01:25:34.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t ask. Is Kane crowning THAT [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.747" end="01:25:35.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE&#39;S HUMAN. WHAT RIGHT DOES SHE HAVE?</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.047" end="01:25:38.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE SAVED HIM.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.647" end="01:25:40.647" style="s2">Broke the curse. She&#39;s his fated mate.</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.447" end="01:25:41.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILITH WAS HIS FATED MATE, TOO. LOOK</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.647" end="01:25:44.747" style="s2">WHAT HAPPENED.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.647" end="01:25:44.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S WHY YOU&#39;RE IN HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.447" end="01:25:51.749" style="s2">KANE, I&#39;ll never let you be happy.</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.249" end="01:25:51.749" style="s2">Never.</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.549" end="01:25:57.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today I crown my fated mate. She is Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.948" end="01:25:59.749" style="s2">From this day forward, she is your Luna</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.749" end="01:26:02.049" style="s2">as well. Ready?</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.749" end="01:26:02.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready.</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.149" end="01:26:06.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All hail THE LUNA.</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.549" end="01:26:07.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I OBJECT.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.448" end="01:26:10.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT DID YOU SAY?</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.349" end="01:26:12.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE&#39;S HUMAN. OUR PACK HAS NEVER HAD A</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.049" end="01:26:15.349" style="s2">HUMAN LUNA. THIS GOES AGAINST THE</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.349" end="01:26:16.549" style="s2">ANCIENT LAWS. WE CANNOT LET A HUMAN RULE</p>
<p begin="01:26:15.349" end="01:26:18.448" style="s2">OVER THE PACK.</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.549" end="01:26:21.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FINISHED?</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.448" end="01:26:23.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KANE, as our alpha</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.349" end="01:26:25.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As your alpha, I hold the right to</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.349" end="01:26:28.049" style="s2">choose my mate. The third law of our</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.549" end="01:26:31.049" style="s2">pack&#39;s ancient codes, fated mates know</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.049" end="01:26:33.149" style="s2">no race, and once bound, the whole pack</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.049" end="01:26:34.209" style="s2">must acknowledge their union. Are the</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.149" end="01:26:34.448" style="s2">two of you deaf?</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.209" end="01:26:36.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.448" end="01:26:38.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.149" end="01:26:40.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder, have you forgotten?</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.049" end="01:26:42.549" style="s2">Lilith wasn&#39;t pure blood either. The</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.149" end="01:26:46.249" style="s2">master married her just the same. Why is</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.549" end="01:26:46.249" style="s2">Lady Ivy any different?</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.448" end="01:26:50.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many years did you follow Red?</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.948" end="01:26:53.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I I never.</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.149" end="01:26:55.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your names are written in Red&#39;s ledgers.</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.448" end="01:26:58.549" style="s2">50 years ago, you helped him transport</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.849" end="01:26:58.549" style="s2">his cargo.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.749" end="01:27:03.349" style="s2">I was going to let it slide because of</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.249" end="01:27:05.049" style="s2">your age, but you just had to dig your</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.349" end="01:27:08.049" style="s2">own graves.</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.049" end="01:27:10.149" style="s2">Take them away. Lock them up.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.049" end="01:27:10.948" style="s2">Let them keep Red company.</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.149" end="01:27:13.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KANE,</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.948" end="01:27:15.349" style="s2">YOU&#39;LL REGRET THIS.</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.749" end="01:27:17.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE ONLY THING I REGRET IS NOT killing</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.349" end="01:27:17.849" style="s2">you sooner.</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.849" end="01:27:24.549" style="s2">Anyone else object? Then mark my words.</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.549" end="01:27:27.948" style="s2">From today on, Ivy is your Luna. Respect</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.549" end="01:27:29.649" style="s2">her, and you have my respect. Anyone who</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.948" end="01:27:33.149" style="s2">harms her,</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.649" end="01:27:35.448" style="s2">I will slaughter their entire bloodline.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.149" end="01:27:35.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All hail the Luna.</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.749" end="01:27:39.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was that a little harsh?</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.049" end="01:27:39.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m not harsh, they won&#39;t listen.</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.055" end="01:27:40.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.710" end="01:27:43.049" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.948" end="01:27:44.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did those two elders really help Red?</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.049" end="01:27:45.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all in the ledgers.</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.749" end="01:27:46.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why didn&#39;t you deal with them</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.549" end="01:27:49.550" style="s2">sooner?</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.448" end="01:27:53.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was waiting for them to make the first</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.550" end="01:27:56.085" style="s2">Now my punishment is fully justified.</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.750" end="01:27:57.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pretty sly.</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.085" end="01:28:00.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.150" end="01:28:00.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Learned from you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.550" end="01:28:07.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I have to wear this all the time?</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.750" end="01:28:10.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, my lady. Only for formal occasions.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.350" end="01:28:10.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. It&#39;s far too heavy.</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.950" end="01:28:17.250" style="s2">Just speak your mind.</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.650" end="01:28:18.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, if I may speak freely.</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.250" end="01:28:20.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on.</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.550" end="01:28:22.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you first arrived,</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.650" end="01:28:22.950" style="s2">I admit I thought you weren&#39;t worthy of</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.150" end="01:28:23.950" style="s2">the master.</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.950" end="01:28:25.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now?</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.950" end="01:28:28.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I believe the master isn&#39;t worthy of</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.950" end="01:28:30.250" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.050" end="01:28:31.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such flattery.</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.250" end="01:28:35.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I meant every word.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.650" end="01:28:35.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Thank you, elder.</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.150" end="01:28:42.350" style="s2">From sacrifice to Luna.</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.250" end="01:28:43.750" style="s2">I actually made it. What plans do you</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.350" end="01:28:45.550" style="s2">have for us from now on?</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.750" end="01:28:46.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking you to see the world.</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.550" end="01:28:48.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.550" end="01:28:50.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s an ocean to the south.</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.550" end="01:28:50.950" style="s2">Have you ever seen the ocean?</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.050" end="01:28:53.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.950" end="01:28:56.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll go see the ocean. Then north</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.550" end="01:28:57.750" style="s2">for the snow, east for the grasslands.</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.550" end="01:28:59.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re coming with me?</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.750" end="01:29:00.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obviously. You think I&#39;d let you go</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.650" end="01:29:01.750" style="s2">alone?</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.350" end="01:29:03.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the estate?</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.750" end="01:29:05.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder and Marcus can handle it.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.750" end="01:29:07.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You trust them that much?</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.250" end="01:29:09.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I worry far more about leaving you here</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.650" end="01:29:10.450" style="s2">by yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.450" end="01:29:11.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When do we leave?</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.450" end="01:29:13.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whenever you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="01:29:11.850" end="01:29:14.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m ready now.</p>
<p begin="01:29:13.150" end="01:29:16.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That soon?</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.750" end="01:29:18.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never left Blackwood Town my whole</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.350" end="01:29:21.550" style="s2">life. Now that I&#39;m finally free, of</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.950" end="01:29:22.750" style="s2">course I want to see everything.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.550" end="01:29:23.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we leave tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.750" end="01:29:25.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fast?</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.550" end="01:29:26.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not much to pack anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.850" end="01:29:27.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kane.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.250" end="01:29:28.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah?</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.450" end="01:29:29.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.850" end="01:29:31.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.950" end="01:29:34.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For marrying me,</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.450" end="01:29:35.750" style="s2">for giving me a home, for making me not</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.050" end="01:29:39.250" style="s2">a sacrifice anymore, but</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.750" end="01:29:39.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were never a sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.750" end="01:29:44.150" style="s2">You&#39;re the one I waited 500 years for.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.050" end="01:29:46.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safe travels, master.</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.150" end="01:29:49.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The estate is in your hands. Send word</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.550" end="01:29:50.550" style="s2">if any trouble arises. Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.050" end="01:29:51.351" style="s2">keep an eye on Red.</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.550" end="01:29:52.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t overwork</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.351" end="01:29:54.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; him.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.052" end="01:29:56.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest assured, my lady.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.251" end="01:29:56.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.151" end="01:30:00.251" style="s2">The master&#39;s changed.</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.351" end="01:30:00.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. He&#39;s finally starting to act</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.251" end="01:30:01.951" style="s2">human.</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.851" end="01:30:03.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he heard you say that, you&#39;d be in</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.951" end="01:30:06.951" style="s2">deep trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.552" end="01:30:06.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why we keep it between us.</p>
<p begin="01:30:07.351" end="01:30:10.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slow down.</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.651" end="01:30:17.052" style="s2">Kane.</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.151" end="01:30:19.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah?</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.052" end="01:30:21.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something I haven&#39;t told you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:19.552" end="01:30:23.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.151" end="01:30:23.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.751" end="01:30:26.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.951" end="01:30:27.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.151" end="01:30:28.251" style="s2">About a month along.</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.451" end="01:30:32.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.251" end="01:30:33.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Elder had a healer check yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.351" end="01:30:36.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful, I&#39;m pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.451" end="01:30:36.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, right. No spinning.</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.751" end="01:30:39.451" style="s2">There&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.951" end="01:30:41.851" style="s2">our child in there?</p>
<p begin="01:30:39.451" end="01:30:41.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.251" end="01:30:45.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swear I&#39;ll protect you both with my</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.951" end="01:30:48.351" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:30:45.552" end="01:30:49.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you will.</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.351" end="01:30:50.351" style="s2">Do you think they&#39;ll look like you or</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.552" end="01:30:51.251" style="s2">like me?</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.351" end="01:30:52.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.251" end="01:30:53.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.151" end="01:30:53.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they look like you, they&#39;ll never be</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.251" end="01:30:55.351" style="s2">lonely.</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.751" end="01:30:56.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not lonely anymore either.</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.351" end="01:30:59.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.151" end="01:30:59.151" style="s2">I&#39;m not lonely anymore.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
